(5092192, 742815, 40718, '<td valign="top">First one up.  Nicely done.  The seeds floating in the air give that extra feeling of time.  Although most portraits do best with eye contact, this one does just fine.</td>', 'First one up.  Nicely done.  The seeds floating in the air give that extra feeling of time.  Although most portraits do best with eye contact, this one does just fine.', '2008-12-01 00:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
