(5092206, 743682, 40718, '<td valign="top">Seen this place before. :)  Can''t remember if it was MAK or Marbo or someone else.  Clear, crisp colors.  Simple and uncluttered with nice flow.  The stars add nicely.  On the downside, it''s perhaps too aseptic.  Pretty, but where''s the depth of thought a picture can conjure? 7</td>', 'Seen this place before. :)  Can''t remember if it was MAK or Marbo or someone else.  Clear, crisp colors.  Simple and uncluttered with nice flow.  The stars add nicely.  On the downside, it''s perhaps too aseptic.  Pretty, but where''s the depth of thought a picture can conjure? 7', '2008-12-01 00:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5092209, 742210, 34938, '<td valign="top">has to be irenem... so signature...if it''s not I am a monkey''s uncle! 9</td>', 'has to be irenem... so signature...if it''s not I am a monkey''s uncle! 9', '2008-12-01 00:05:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5092213, 742699, 40718, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Clean, crisp colors.  Almost exactly the same thing I said about the last one. ;)  DPC to a tee.  I can''t fault that at all, although my 9s and 10s are going to shots that stir something within. 7</td>', 'Nice composition.  Clean, crisp colors.  Almost exactly the same thing I said about the last one. ;)  DPC to a tee.  I can''t fault that at all, although my 9s and 10s are going to shots that stir something within. 7', '2008-12-01 00:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
