(5092217, 743556, 70000, '<td valign="top">Nice variety in the tones and colors on the rocks. It makes everything look so soft. Great sky too! The composition gets a little convoluted in that there isn''t a real focal point, but nice shot</td>', 'Nice variety in the tones and colors on the rocks. It makes everything look so soft. Great sky too! The composition gets a little convoluted in that there isn''t a real focal point, but nice shot', '2008-12-01 00:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
