(5092230, 743766, 40718, '<td valign="top">Two issues.  One, I''m looking for a bit more contrast at the horizon.  Two, my eye looks for a focal point to land on and can''t find one.  It''s still a well done shot, especially from a plane. 6</td>', 'Two issues.  One, I''m looking for a bit more contrast at the horizon.  Two, my eye looks for a focal point to land on and can''t find one.  It''s still a well done shot, especially from a plane. 6', '2008-12-01 00:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5092231, 736509, 70000, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective. The colors are nice too.</td>', 'Nice perspective. The colors are nice too.', '2008-12-01 00:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5092234, 743204, 70000, '<td valign="top">I like that this is monochrome. It is a little jarring at first look. It takes a minute to figure out what is going on within the landscape. Nice variety in the tones.</td>', 'I like that this is monochrome. It is a little jarring at first look. It takes a minute to figure out what is going on within the landscape. Nice variety in the tones.', '2008-12-01 00:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5092237, 743152, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''m not the typical DPC voter but I''d much prefer this in BW. Wish the champagne bucket wasn''t cropped off. Love the story and juxtaposition between the man and woman''s expressions and positions in the shot.</td>', 'I''m not the typical DPC voter but I''d much prefer this in BW. Wish the champagne bucket wasn''t cropped off. Love the story and juxtaposition between the man and woman''s expressions and positions in the shot.', '2008-12-01 00:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
