(5092277, 739636, 15711, '<td valign="top">WOW  that took some nerve with this crowd.  FANTASTIC WORK. I love the juxtaposition between the angel and "Jesus." Great focus and contrast.</td>', 'WOW  that took some nerve with this crowd.  FANTASTIC WORK. I love the juxtaposition between the angel and "Jesus." Great focus and contrast.', '2008-12-01 00:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5092278, 743667, 40718, '<td valign="top">I like wave shots so much.  Nice choice of shutter speed.  Gives both enough blur for motion, but not too much to obliterate that wave.  On my monitor the pink on the right was pushed perhaps a tiny bit too far.  It almost looks neon to me.  The rock adds a nice focal point. 7</td>', 'I like wave shots so much.  Nice choice of shutter speed.  Gives both enough blur for motion, but not too much to obliterate that wave.  On my monitor the pink on the right was pushed perhaps a tiny bit too far.  It almost looks neon to me.  The rock adds a nice focal point. 7', '2008-12-01 00:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5092281, 739513, 70000, '<td valign="top">The technical skills here are nice. I feel it lacks a focal point though.</td>', 'The technical skills here are nice. I feel it lacks a focal point though.', '2008-12-01 00:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
