(5092302, 737872, 40718, '<td valign="top">Nice trick shot.  The star adds nicely.  A small nitpick, but my eye wants the bulb a bit to the right, maybe so the edge is past the crack.  Still, it''s well done and I don''t get any sense of the wires that were used to light the bulb. 8</td>', 'Nice trick shot.  The star adds nicely.  A small nitpick, but my eye wants the bulb a bit to the right, maybe so the edge is past the crack.  Still, it''s well done and I don''t get any sense of the wires that were used to light the bulb. 8', '2008-12-01 00:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
