(5094278, 741231, 90495, '<td valign="top">Stunning and calm, windless, serene, desolate, natural, untouched, unaffected by the parasitic sickness which we call humanity.</td>', 'Stunning and calm, windless, serene, desolate, natural, untouched, unaffected by the parasitic sickness which we call humanity.', '2008-12-01 11:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5094284, 743667, 44611, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, I particularly like the soft focus and muted blues.  Personally would have ditched the frame though, I''m not sure it enhances this image.</td>', 'Lovely shot, I particularly like the soft focus and muted blues.  Personally would have ditched the frame though, I''m not sure it enhances this image.', '2008-12-01 11:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5094293, 739163, 90495, '<td valign="top">This is beautifully captured. I''m not being overly impressed though and I''m wondering why? Could it be the lack of shadows that could add depth to this shot or the lack of sunshine? Colours are natural and fitting to this scene although my eyes just cannot seem to stay in one place, they''re all over the place looking for a main point of focus. In other words, it doesn''t really stand out from other waterfall shots that I have seen although it is a fine image indeed.</td>', 'This is beautifully captured. I''m not being overly impressed though and I''m wondering why? Could it be the lack of shadows that could add depth to this shot or the lack of sunshine? Colours are natural and fitting to this scene although my eyes just cannot seem to stay in one place, they''re all over the place looking for a main point of focus. In other words, it doesn''t really stand out from other waterfall shots that I have seen although it is a fine image indeed.', '2008-12-01 11:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5094295, 743766, 90495, '<td valign="top">Indonesia? Canada?<br/> <br/>Very lovely image that is very captivating to the eye. I like. :)</td>', 'Indonesia? Canada? Very lovely image that is very captivating to the eye. I like. :)', '2008-12-01 11:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5094299, 741807, 90495, '<td valign="top">Great portrait and a wonderful smile that looks so natural. Beautiful tonal values throughout. Well done.</td>', 'Great portrait and a wonderful smile that looks so natural. Beautiful tonal values throughout. Well done.', '2008-12-01 11:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5094304, 743542, 58380, '<td valign="top">nice lighting, the smoke and the body art are a great touch aswell. i love the metalic looking skin!</td>', 'nice lighting, the smoke and the body art are a great touch aswell. i love the metalic looking skin!', '2008-12-01 12:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5094313, 741086, 30049, '<td valign="top"><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=17850" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Pascal</a>?  Hmmm...can''t be him - no ribbons.  <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=78356" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Sanjuro</a>?<br/> <br/>Dang!  Not him either, only 1 ribbon.<br/> <br/>No offense to whomever''s this is...the style of this photo just reminded me of the above 2 photographers (location, subject, processing style, etc...).<br/> <br/>It''s a lovely image.  Good luck in the challenge.  :-)</td>', ' Pascal?  Hmmm...can''t be him - no ribbons.   Sanjuro? Dang!  Not him either, only 1 ribbon. No offense to whomever''s this is...the style of this photo just reminded me of the above 2 photographers (location, subject, processing style, etc...). It''s a lovely image.  Good luck in the challenge.  :-)', '2008-12-01 12:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
