(5094348, 743585, 75585, '<td valign="top">Now that is one new baby - very precious.  I think having the pinky of the adult in the frame and a little more space between the top of the head and the top of the frame would have been nice.  Having said that - shooting newborns involves so much that is isn''t so much easier to sit and critique and do the hindsight game and this is still a great keepsake that will be treasured for many years I am sure!</td>', 'Now that is one new baby - very precious.  I think having the pinky of the adult in the frame and a little more space between the top of the head and the top of the frame would have been nice.  Having said that - shooting newborns involves so much that is isn''t so much easier to sit and critique and do the hindsight game and this is still a great keepsake that will be treasured for many years I am sure!', '2008-12-01 12:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
