(5095522, 741866, 82707, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image, I love the simple (but very well toned) lines, and the hint of red in the B&amp;W.  The shoes are the perfect compliment, as they make her look like she is almost floating.</td>', 'Beautiful image, I love the simple (but very well toned) lines, and the hint of red in the B&W.  The shoes are the perfect compliment, as they make her look like she is almost floating.', '2008-12-01 19:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
