(5095920, 743614, 811, '<td valign="top">I love the perspective of this and the overall brightness.</td>', 'I love the perspective of this and the overall brightness.', '2008-12-01 20:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5095921, 742815, 811, '<td valign="top">Awesome capture.  I love the warmth in this one.</td>', 'Awesome capture.  I love the warmth in this one.', '2008-12-01 20:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5095936, 741528, 811, '<td valign="top">The lighting on this is excellent.  The only "nit pick" is that it looks more like he is being impaled by the cigar, rather than smoking it.</td>', 'The lighting on this is excellent.  The only "nit pick" is that it looks more like he is being impaled by the cigar, rather than smoking it.', '2008-12-01 21:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5095940, 739968, 811, '<td valign="top">Awesome bw.  I really like the contrast and tones in this.  Also, the moon, though tiny in relative size, really adds to the image.</td>', 'Awesome bw.  I really like the contrast and tones in this.  Also, the moon, though tiny in relative size, really adds to the image.', '2008-12-01 21:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5095954, 737191, 811, '<td valign="top">Great capture of a moment in time.  I like the blown out quality of the white.  It really focuses the attention on her shirt and gives it a very "clean" look.</td>', 'Great capture of a moment in time.  I like the blown out quality of the white.  It really focuses the attention on her shirt and gives it a very "clean" look.', '2008-12-01 21:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5095956, 741564, 63398, '<td valign="top">Absolutely incredible detail! I gave this a 9 because I feel it reflects the level of grace, talent, and beauty that we all too often miss being able to capture, and I have to say how amazed I am. Just gorgeous!</td>', 'Absolutely incredible detail! I gave this a 9 because I feel it reflects the level of grace, talent, and beauty that we all too often miss being able to capture, and I have to say how amazed I am. Just gorgeous!', '2008-12-01 21:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5095959, 743636, 63398, '<td valign="top">I don''t know how you did it. I''ve been to concerts, and I''ve tried many times to get something even close, with miserable results. Extraordinary concert shot, and with the lighting and perspective, I think the B&amp;W was a perfect choice. PERFECT composition 9</td>', 'I don''t know how you did it. I''ve been to concerts, and I''ve tried many times to get something even close, with miserable results. Extraordinary concert shot, and with the lighting and perspective, I think the B&W was a perfect choice. PERFECT composition 9', '2008-12-01 21:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5095962, 742699, 811, '<td valign="top">Looks like snow.  I like the minimalist feeling of this.</td>', 'Looks like snow.  I like the minimalist feeling of this.', '2008-12-01 21:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5095964, 742702, 40718, '<td valign="top">Well controlled B&amp;W.  Interesting addition to the portrait, but why?  Maybe in a sorta haute couture way where you just do it because it''s weird.  I can go for that. 8</td>', 'Well controlled B&W.  Interesting addition to the portrait, but why?  Maybe in a sorta haute couture way where you just do it because it''s weird.  I can go for that. 8', '2008-12-01 21:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5095967, 743755, 40718, '<td valign="top">I like the pagoda.  The distortion from the wide angle gets to me a bit on the right, but it''s not a biggie. 7</td>', 'I like the pagoda.  The distortion from the wide angle gets to me a bit on the right, but it''s not a biggie. 7', '2008-12-01 21:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5095968, 743459, 63398, '<td valign="top">A truly incredible capture of an oh-so-rare scene. Extremely well done with an extra point for degree of difficulty. 9</td>', 'A truly incredible capture of an oh-so-rare scene. Extremely well done with an extra point for degree of difficulty. 9', '2008-12-01 21:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5095971, 738990, 40718, '<td valign="top">Interesting take.  I''m taking a few seconds to pull it in and decide whether I like it or not.  I think what gets me the most is the noise in the light pinks on the lower right.  Either that was from color shifting or it was a noisy image to start with.  Ultimately this isn''t my cup of tea. 5</td>', 'Interesting take.  I''m taking a few seconds to pull it in and decide whether I like it or not.  I think what gets me the most is the noise in the light pinks on the lower right.  Either that was from color shifting or it was a noisy image to start with.  Ultimately this isn''t my cup of tea. 5', '2008-12-01 21:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5095972, 743542, 63398, '<td valign="top">Tasteful and sensuous. An incredible image and composition. Beautiful young woman enhanced by the mystery and artistry of your composition. 9</td>', 'Tasteful and sensuous. An incredible image and composition. Beautiful young woman enhanced by the mystery and artistry of your composition. 9', '2008-12-01 21:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5095974, 741030, 40718, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract.  I just saw one I didn''t like, but this one I can go for.  An electric razor?  The diagonal of the highlight is nice. 7</td>', 'Nice abstract.  I just saw one I didn''t like, but this one I can go for.  An electric razor?  The diagonal of the highlight is nice. 7', '2008-12-01 21:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5095976, 743291, 63398, '<td valign="top">Profound and disturbing to me. This image makes me confront my own mortality and that scares me. Extraordinary &amp; gutsy. 9</td>', 'Profound and disturbing to me. This image makes me confront my own mortality and that scares me. Extraordinary & gutsy. 9', '2008-12-01 21:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5095977, 743222, 61651, '<td valign="top">Lovely evocation of uninhibited childhood.  I don''t usually guess photographers in my comments, but this struck me immediately as something Melethia would enter.</td>', 'Lovely evocation of uninhibited childhood.  I don''t usually guess photographers in my comments, but this struck me immediately as something Melethia would enter.', '2008-12-01 21:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5095978, 742392, 63398, '<td valign="top">This image is just so happ-go-lucky and intriguing. I really love it on so many levels. A terrific concept, very well executed. Terrific deatil and I love the white negative space. Fav &amp; 9</td>', 'This image is just so happ-go-lucky and intriguing. I really love it on so many levels. A terrific concept, very well executed. Terrific deatil and I love the white negative space. Fav & 9', '2008-12-01 21:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5095981, 742969, 811, '<td valign="top">This guy reminds me of pictures I''ve seen of MAK.  The expression on his face (what you can see of it) looks to me like he''s either just heard a weird noise and he is looking to see what it is or he''s guilty of something and he is looking to see if someone is following him.  :)</td>', 'This guy reminds me of pictures I''ve seen of MAK.  The expression on his face (what you can see of it) looks to me like he''s either just heard a weird noise and he is looking to see what it is or he''s guilty of something and he is looking to see if someone is following him.  :)', '2008-12-01 21:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5095985, 742353, 46336, '<td valign="top">Glorious colours, and a beautiful sense of motion from the siloette. And yet it just does not work - mainly because of the unnatural purple on the clouds, which really gives the editting game away. I believe a landscape crop of the bottom half of the image would have been much more powerful.</td>', 'Glorious colours, and a beautiful sense of motion from the siloette. And yet it just does not work - mainly because of the unnatural purple on the clouds, which really gives the editting game away. I believe a landscape crop of the bottom half of the image would have been much more powerful.', '2008-12-01 21:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5095987, 743422, 63398, '<td valign="top">Haunting, moody, &amp; evocative. Love the duotone B&amp;W, and the image detail and quality is superb. The leading lines work beautifully. Fav &amp; 9</td>', 'Haunting, moody, & evocative. Love the duotone B&W, and the image detail and quality is superb. The leading lines work beautifully. Fav & 9', '2008-12-01 21:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5095990, 743459, 811, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  It almost looks oversharpened in the water splashes, but that could just be the droplets.</td>', 'Great capture.  It almost looks oversharpened in the water splashes, but that could just be the droplets.', '2008-12-01 21:22:20.000000', NULL, 1),
