(5096284, 737982, 67841, '<td valign="top">Superb capture, very emotive.  The light and focus really grab you &amp; focus your attention on the eyes where a whole story is written &amp; ready to grip you by the heart.  I''ve visited impoverished areas across South America, sat &amp; listened to stories from kids like these - this image brings those back in a flood.  <br/> <br/>-- 10 --</td>', 'Superb capture, very emotive.  The light and focus really grab you & focus your attention on the eyes where a whole story is written & ready to grip you by the heart.  I''ve visited impoverished areas across South America, sat & listened to stories from kids like these - this image brings those back in a flood.   -- 10 --', '2008-12-01 22:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5096287, 738990, 67841, '<td valign="top">Bravely put forth here, knowing the sometimes fickle nature of the DPC voter.  The colors &amp; silhouette are very compelling with the abstract nature of the focus really making the image a little more fun, IMHO.  Nicely done -- 8 --</td>', 'Bravely put forth here, knowing the sometimes fickle nature of the DPC voter.  The colors & silhouette are very compelling with the abstract nature of the focus really making the image a little more fun, IMHO.  Nicely done -- 8 --', '2008-12-01 22:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5096291, 743600, 67841, '<td valign="top">Nice - I like how the spiral continues abstractly in the background - color is pleasing, as is the composition in general. -- 7 --</td>', 'Nice - I like how the spiral continues abstractly in the background - color is pleasing, as is the composition in general. -- 7 --', '2008-12-01 22:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5096303, 743617, 25787, '<td valign="top">Wow.  As powerful as DeSousa''s Last Supper.  What great attention to detail.</td>', 'Wow.  As powerful as DeSousa''s Last Supper.  What great attention to detail.', '2008-12-01 22:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5096304, 743598, 67841, '<td valign="top">Epic!  Your treatment certainly contributes to the feeling of how cyclical these fires can be - this could be a picture from 100 years ago.  The forest burns, feeds the ground, heals &amp; grows back stronger &amp; richer.<br/> <br/>-- 7 --</td>', 'Epic!  Your treatment certainly contributes to the feeling of how cyclical these fires can be - this could be a picture from 100 years ago.  The forest burns, feeds the ground, heals & grows back stronger & richer. -- 7 --', '2008-12-01 22:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5096312, 743361, 73564, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait and lighting, 8.</td>', 'Nice portrait and lighting, 8.', '2008-12-01 22:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5096313, 743192, 73564, '<td valign="top">Great detail captured, nice comp and colors, 8.</td>', 'Great detail captured, nice comp and colors, 8.', '2008-12-01 22:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5096316, 743720, 73564, '<td valign="top">Neat image, I really like this one, comp is great, 8.</td>', 'Neat image, I really like this one, comp is great, 8.', '2008-12-01 22:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5096318, 743436, 67841, '<td valign="top">Pretty location, photo has a bit of HDR-ness to it.  Since the sky isn''t adding much, I would have considered framing lower, giving more weight to the more interesting foreground.  Also, the red building on the hill could have been placed a little better in the composition, bring attention to it more, by moving left or right.  -- 6 --</td>', 'Pretty location, photo has a bit of HDR-ness to it.  Since the sky isn''t adding much, I would have considered framing lower, giving more weight to the more interesting foreground.  Also, the red building on the hill could have been placed a little better in the composition, bring attention to it more, by moving left or right.  -- 6 --', '2008-12-01 22:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5096319, 736918, 73564, '<td valign="top">Aww, what an adorable picture, great comp and lighting, 9.</td>', 'Aww, what an adorable picture, great comp and lighting, 9.', '2008-12-01 22:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5096323, 743452, 73564, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, I was hoping for some oob ideas for this challenge, nice capture and comp. 7.</td>', 'Nice capture, I was hoping for some oob ideas for this challenge, nice capture and comp. 7.', '2008-12-01 22:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
