(5096326, 740846, 73564, '<td valign="top">This looks like a portrait of Orlando Bloom, quite close. Great lighting and capture of expression, cool colors, great work...9.</td>', 'This looks like a portrait of Orlando Bloom, quite close. Great lighting and capture of expression, cool colors, great work...9.', '2008-12-01 23:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5096333, 741010, 60698, '<td valign="top">Nice warm color! Great expression!</td>', 'Nice warm color! Great expression!', '2008-12-01 23:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5096335, 743174, 73564, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and great in b&amp;w, I understand the frame placement because of the shadow, but if she were moved in a wee bit more, and the door jam were cropped this imo, would have been super fabulous. But its not too bad the way it is now, I really like it. 9 besides who''s the master...lol</td>', 'Nice lighting and great in b&w, I understand the frame placement because of the shadow, but if she were moved in a wee bit more, and the door jam were cropped this imo, would have been super fabulous. But its not too bad the way it is now, I really like it. 9 besides who''s the master...lol', '2008-12-01 23:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
