(5096351, 739968, 73564, '<td valign="top">Neat patterns/textures within the land, I like the white tree out front and the sky is wicked, Nice take, good work. 10.</td>', 'Neat patterns/textures within the land, I like the white tree out front and the sky is wicked, Nice take, good work. 10.', '2008-12-01 23:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5096353, 741422, 73564, '<td valign="top">Nice comp, great capture, neat colors, 7.</td>', 'Nice comp, great capture, neat colors, 7.', '2008-12-01 23:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5096356, 743222, 67841, '<td valign="top">Oh, superb!  This has got a nice array of elements which contribute solidly to the mood &amp; title.  I love th empathetic connection to the girl &amp; how it seems like she could almost keep rising up - such a strong ''Mary Poppins''-esque feel to a very emotive candid... -- 10 --</td>', 'Oh, superb!  This has got a nice array of elements which contribute solidly to the mood & title.  I love th empathetic connection to the girl & how it seems like she could almost keep rising up - such a strong ''Mary Poppins''-esque feel to a very emotive candid... -- 10 --', '2008-12-01 23:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5096357, 743617, 73564, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting mix, Nice colors and comp, neat idea, 10.</td>', 'This is an interesting mix, Nice colors and comp, neat idea, 10.', '2008-12-01 23:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5096359, 743741, 73564, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, good colors, 7.</td>', 'Nice capture, good colors, 7.', '2008-12-01 23:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5096361, 741864, 60698, '<td valign="top">How creative and clever!! This must have taken some time to set up. Nice angle and lighting!<br/>Since I am a geek and work on these things all day, I just *have* to make this a favorite! Great name! Love it!!</td>', 'How creative and clever!! This must have taken some time to set up. Nice angle and lighting!Since I am a geek and work on these things all day, I just *have* to make this a favorite! Great name! Love it!!', '2008-12-01 23:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5096364, 743766, 73564, '<td valign="top">Nice image! Great pov, colors are great, and I like the tad bit of haze, nice work, 10.</td>', 'Nice image! Great pov, colors are great, and I like the tad bit of haze, nice work, 10.', '2008-12-01 23:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5096365, 743339, 67841, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors!  The scene is certainly perplexing - I''m compelled to want to learn more about the story here, what the building is &amp; why the low water level.  Can''t just be the tide, that''s way too much - makes me think of the Dead Sea...  -- 7 --</td>', 'Very nice colors!  The scene is certainly perplexing - I''m compelled to want to learn more about the story here, what the building is & why the low water level.  Can''t just be the tide, that''s way too much - makes me think of the Dead Sea...  -- 7 --', '2008-12-01 23:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5096372, 743191, 67841, '<td valign="top">Interesting range of colors, light &amp; effects here.  I like quite a bit of it, but am a *little* put off by the uncorrected perspective on the stairs.  I personally never do lens corrections on my wide angles, but for some reason the mix of natural &amp; man-made objects here kind of begs for it.  Regardless, this is a nicely done...  -- 7 --</td>', 'Interesting range of colors, light & effects here.  I like quite a bit of it, but am a *little* put off by the uncorrected perspective on the stairs.  I personally never do lens corrections on my wide angles, but for some reason the mix of natural & man-made objects here kind of begs for it.  Regardless, this is a nicely done...  -- 7 --', '2008-12-01 23:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5096373, 743749, 73564, '<td valign="top">Nice colors!! Great comp, focus and lighting, I''m glad not to see just ducks...there''s a whole more to go with them, great work. 10.</td>', 'Nice colors!! Great comp, focus and lighting, I''m glad not to see just ducks...there''s a whole more to go with them, great work. 10.', '2008-12-01 23:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5096376, 743384, 67841, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous colors - nice range of exposure.  Reminds me of Lake Superior &amp; those look almost like the Huron Mountains off in the distance. -- 7 --</td>', 'Gorgeous colors - nice range of exposure.  Reminds me of Lake Superior & those look almost like the Huron Mountains off in the distance. -- 7 --', '2008-12-01 23:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5096377, 743309, 73564, '<td valign="top">WOW! This fabtastic! lol, I just got done voting on a picture with ducks and water, it was amazing, I said in my comment I was glad not to see "just ducks" but man, this one totally rules. Beautiful colors and clarity, amazing, 10. Good luck!</td>', 'WOW! This fabtastic! lol, I just got done voting on a picture with ducks and water, it was amazing, I said in my comment I was glad not to see "just ducks" but man, this one totally rules. Beautiful colors and clarity, amazing, 10. Good luck!', '2008-12-01 23:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5096379, 742897, 7969, '<td valign="top">I wonder where this was taken and by whom... hmmmm<br/>I can''t believe you have edited already... I have bearly started editing.  <br/>Nice job, classic PB!</td>', 'I wonder where this was taken and by whom... hmmmmI can''t believe you have edited already... I have bearly started editing.  Nice job, classic PB!', '2008-12-01 23:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5096380, 741231, 73564, '<td valign="top">Oh WOW! Great colors and comp. So simplistic, yet so gorgeous. My first fav of this challenge, GOOD LUCK! 10</td>', 'Oh WOW! Great colors and comp. So simplistic, yet so gorgeous. My first fav of this challenge, GOOD LUCK! 10', '2008-12-01 23:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
