(5096418, 743090, 67841, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, but I''m missing the eye-connection here.  He looks a bit life-less which makes me think it''s a stuffed lion.  Pretty animal, nonetheless!</td>', 'Nice lighting, but I''m missing the eye-connection here.  He looks a bit life-less which makes me think it''s a stuffed lion.  Pretty animal, nonetheless!', '2008-12-01 23:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
