(5097588, 735972, 43774, '<td valign="top">How nice!! I might have placed the flower more on a diagonal, but that''s just my personal preference for diagonal compositions.</td>', 'How nice!! I might have placed the flower more on a diagonal, but that''s just my personal preference for diagonal compositions.', '2008-12-02 10:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
