(5097616, 743709, 78455, '<td valign="top">A nice image overall, however a little bit more space given to the foreground in order to include the full reflection of the main rock formation may have benefited this composition. A slight slant of the horizon to the left is also noticeable, not much but visible nonetheless! I''m nit picking here, but as a master''s challenge, I feel I ought to judge it as such and will mark you a point down as a result. Normal FS = 7, this challenge = 6.</td>', 'A nice image overall, however a little bit more space given to the foreground in order to include the full reflection of the main rock formation may have benefited this composition. A slight slant of the horizon to the left is also noticeable, not much but visible nonetheless! I''m nit picking here, but as a master''s challenge, I feel I ought to judge it as such and will mark you a point down as a result. Normal FS = 7, this challenge = 6.', '2008-12-02 11:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5097619, 743592, 78455, '<td valign="top">Wow...very vibrant! nice processing! 8</td>', 'Wow...very vibrant! nice processing! 8', '2008-12-02 11:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
