(5097633, 743578, 811, '<td valign="top">The man helps to "anchor" the shot, but I can''t help but think I would probably like ti more if he weren''t in there. . .</td>', 'The man helps to "anchor" the shot, but I can''t help but think I would probably like ti more if he weren''t in there. . .', '2008-12-02 11:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
