(5098839, 743330, 63269, '<td valign="top">The composition is a little cluttered imho. My eyes aren''t quite sure where to go and end up wandering around the photograph. Also I would suggest different lighting or a brighter exposure, since it is very difficult to make any detail out on the statues, which seem to be a main component of the subject. I do like the blue and gold colors on the building though!</td>', 'The composition is a little cluttered imho. My eyes aren''t quite sure where to go and end up wandering around the photograph. Also I would suggest different lighting or a brighter exposure, since it is very difficult to make any detail out on the statues, which seem to be a main component of the subject. I do like the blue and gold colors on the building though!', '2008-12-02 18:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
