(5098878, 743270, 63269, '<td valign="top">Oh this is so, so beautiful. My only complaint with this photo is the blurred hair across the subject''s face... if it weren''t for that I think this would be a perfect photo. The colors are gorgeous, and I love the color harmony you''ve used - matching the scarf and clothes with the deep blue sky. The motion trails of the grasses, and the stars, the composition, <i>everything </i>is just wonderful. Glorious! :)</td>', 'Oh this is so, so beautiful. My only complaint with this photo is the blurred hair across the subject''s face... if it weren''t for that I think this would be a perfect photo. The colors are gorgeous, and I love the color harmony you''ve used - matching the scarf and clothes with the deep blue sky. The motion trails of the grasses, and the stars, the composition, everything is just wonderful. Glorious! :)', '2008-12-02 18:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
