(5098999, 740041, 63269, '<td valign="top">This could be taken symbolically, perhaps... the bright, angelic little girl directly above the man in the shadows, handing down a gift to him... :) I would be curious to know if this is candid or staged, but it looks real enough to be convincing, making this a powerful photo. My only complaint with this is how indistinct the man at the bottom of the photo is. It took me a sec to figure out what the blob of darkness was. Also I personally think the editing is a little bit too much - the contrast between the blurred adults and the perfectly focused little girl is a little too abrupt.</td>', 'This could be taken symbolically, perhaps... the bright, angelic little girl directly above the man in the shadows, handing down a gift to him... :) I would be curious to know if this is candid or staged, but it looks real enough to be convincing, making this a powerful photo. My only complaint with this is how indistinct the man at the bottom of the photo is. It took me a sec to figure out what the blob of darkness was. Also I personally think the editing is a little bit too much - the contrast between the blurred adults and the perfectly focused little girl is a little too abrupt.', '2008-12-02 19:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
