(5099799, 739163, 40718, '<td valign="top">I love waterfalls like this.  The shutter speed is nice, but the lighting has let you down a bit.  It''s probably hard.  If you got direct light on it you''d blow the water quickly, but without at least dapple, it''s very flat. 6</td>', 'I love waterfalls like this.  The shutter speed is nice, but the lighting has let you down a bit.  It''s probably hard.  If you got direct light on it you''d blow the water quickly, but without at least dapple, it''s very flat. 6', '2008-12-02 22:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
