(5101178, 743617, 99263, '<td valign="top">WOW WOW WOW AND WOW! Excellent, Incredible! You clearly went to a lot of trouble but it was definitely worth it as the result is there for all to see. Stunning. A winner in my book. 10</td>', 'WOW WOW WOW AND WOW! Excellent, Incredible! You clearly went to a lot of trouble but it was definitely worth it as the result is there for all to see. Stunning. A winner in my book. 10', '2008-12-03 09:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5101180, 739963, 99263, '<td valign="top">Absolutely amazing. I just sat there staring at this shot for a very long time and through my head went all kind of things that have to do with time,space,size,moments,perspectives,interpretations of life and things invisible to the human eye. A fantastic shot and technically executed 100 percent. This shot sets the standard for me in this challenge by which to score all the other entries. I don''t hesitate to give it the 10 which it fully deserves.</td>', 'Absolutely amazing. I just sat there staring at this shot for a very long time and through my head went all kind of things that have to do with time,space,size,moments,perspectives,interpretations of life and things invisible to the human eye. A fantastic shot and technically executed 100 percent. This shot sets the standard for me in this challenge by which to score all the other entries. I don''t hesitate to give it the 10 which it fully deserves.', '2008-12-03 09:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
