(5101987, 743303, 98647, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I especially like the boat, and the colour of the foliage.</td>', 'Nice shot. I especially like the boat, and the colour of the foliage.', '2008-12-03 14:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5101989, 742853, 98647, '<td valign="top">I like the treatment on this. The swan is a nice addition. The horizon line seems to be tilted a little. Still a high score from me.</td>', 'I like the treatment on this. The swan is a nice addition. The horizon line seems to be tilted a little. Still a high score from me.', '2008-12-03 14:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5101994, 737872, 98647, '<td valign="top">I gave you a high score primarily because your shot is different. Of course it is also technically well executed. I hope this shot does well.</td>', 'I gave you a high score primarily because your shot is different. Of course it is also technically well executed. I hope this shot does well.', '2008-12-03 14:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5101999, 737191, 98647, '<td valign="top">I like this shot because it tells a story. It''s the type of photo that probably won''t garner you a ribbon here because it isn''t heavily processed and it isn''t perfect technically. However, I can feel her excitement as she watches the ball go down the lane. Wish more photos here were more like this one.</td>', 'I like this shot because it tells a story. It''s the type of photo that probably won''t garner you a ribbon here because it isn''t heavily processed and it isn''t perfect technically. However, I can feel her excitement as she watches the ball go down the lane. Wish more photos here were more like this one.', '2008-12-03 14:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5102004, 743682, 98647, '<td valign="top">Good leading line</td>', 'Good leading line', '2008-12-03 14:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5102017, 739513, 34192, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sky. Colors a little over the top.  Horizon seems tilted, but it could be my head.</td>', 'Beautiful sky. Colors a little over the top.  Horizon seems tilted, but it could be my head.', '2008-12-03 14:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5102018, 741834, 34192, '<td valign="top">Excellent close up and dynamic composition.  Great background color choice.</td>', 'Excellent close up and dynamic composition.  Great background color choice.', '2008-12-03 14:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5102019, 737982, 34192, '<td valign="top">Excellent tonal conversion to black and white.</td>', 'Excellent tonal conversion to black and white.', '2008-12-03 14:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5102022, 742353, 34192, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors.  Feels like there should be an inspirational message at the top.</td>', 'Beautiful colors.  Feels like there should be an inspirational message at the top.', '2008-12-03 14:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5102024, 736494, 34192, '<td valign="top">excellent sharpness.  Good composition.</td>', 'excellent sharpness.  Good composition.', '2008-12-03 14:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5102025, 743384, 98647, '<td valign="top">I like the colours, more natural looking than a lot of similar shots in this challenge, but there really isn''t anything to hold my eye.</td>', 'I like the colours, more natural looking than a lot of similar shots in this challenge, but there really isn''t anything to hold my eye.', '2008-12-03 14:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5102033, 743544, 98647, '<td valign="top">I think I get what you were going for with the contrast between urban (buildings) and rural (horses), but it''s too white. Overexposed?</td>', 'I think I get what you were going for with the contrast between urban (buildings) and rural (horses), but it''s too white. Overexposed?', '2008-12-03 14:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5102040, 743341, 51793, '<td valign="top">Looks like a shannon shot.</td>', 'Looks like a shannon shot.', '2008-12-03 14:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5102043, 741450, 51793, '<td valign="top">very pretty</td>', 'very pretty', '2008-12-03 14:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5102044, 741231, 39427, '<td valign="top">simple and nice, bumping to 8</td>', 'simple and nice, bumping to 8', '2008-12-03 14:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5102047, 743330, 98647, '<td valign="top">The colours on the building are beautiful. The 2 figures obscure the building and detract rather than add anything to the image.</td>', 'The colours on the building are beautiful. The 2 figures obscure the building and detract rather than add anything to the image.', '2008-12-03 14:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5102048, 743636, 51793, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.</td>', 'Nice shot.', '2008-12-03 14:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5102049, 743631, 39427, '<td valign="top">well done all around, very professional</td>', 'well done all around, very professional', '2008-12-03 14:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5102051, 739065, 98647, '<td valign="top">This image has a lot of potential. Composition could be improved by placing the tree in a less centred location in the frame.</td>', 'This image has a lot of potential. Composition could be improved by placing the tree in a less centred location in the frame.', '2008-12-03 14:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5102053, 742353, 98647, '<td valign="top">Really beautiful silhouette, but too much sky.</td>', 'Really beautiful silhouette, but too much sky.', '2008-12-03 14:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5102056, 743436, 98647, '<td valign="top">I really like the colours in the foreground, but I find the background colours in the trees and sky a little dull in comparison. It''s like two different photos.</td>', 'I really like the colours in the foreground, but I find the background colours in the trees and sky a little dull in comparison. It''s like two different photos.', '2008-12-03 14:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5102058, 742848, 51793, '<td valign="top">Looks like something nshapiro would shoot.</td>', 'Looks like something nshapiro would shoot.', '2008-12-03 14:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5102059, 743578, 39427, '<td valign="top">I like what you''re going for here but would like to see what the photo looks like without the model, and then the 2 arrows leveled</td>', 'I like what you''re going for here but would like to see what the photo looks like without the model, and then the 2 arrows leveled', '2008-12-03 14:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5102061, 742699, 98647, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours, but too much sky.</td>', 'Lovely colours, but too much sky.', '2008-12-03 14:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5102065, 742696, 98647, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene, but oversaturated and overprocessed.</td>', 'Beautiful scene, but oversaturated and overprocessed.', '2008-12-03 14:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5102067, 740041, 39427, '<td valign="top">love the PP effects, want to know if it is real or staged</td>', 'love the PP effects, want to know if it is real or staged', '2008-12-03 14:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5102068, 739112, 98647, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but the bubble is obscuring his eye.</td>', 'Interesting, but the bubble is obscuring his eye.', '2008-12-03 14:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5102070, 742969, 98647, '<td valign="top">I don''t really like the post processing. I would probably have scored you higher if it looked a little more "natural". I also would prefer if he wasn''t looking out of the frame.</td>', 'I don''t really like the post processing. I would probably have scored you higher if it looked a little more "natural". I also would prefer if he wasn''t looking out of the frame.', '2008-12-03 14:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5102071, 739564, 98647, '<td valign="top">She looks like she doesn''t have a nose.</td>', 'She looks like she doesn''t have a nose.', '2008-12-03 14:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5102073, 739963, 39427, '<td valign="top">looks kinda disgusting... and alien... haha... still a great technical shot, cool colors</td>', 'looks kinda disgusting... and alien... haha... still a great technical shot, cool colors', '2008-12-03 14:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5102074, 741864, 51793, '<td valign="top">hahhahaha</td>', 'hahhahaha', '2008-12-03 14:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5102077, 740092, 39427, '<td valign="top">Very raw shot, nice.  Could use a bump in contrast IMO</td>', 'Very raw shot, nice.  Could use a bump in contrast IMO', '2008-12-03 14:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5102080, 743466, 39427, '<td valign="top">LOVE the deep hues and details</td>', 'LOVE the deep hues and details', '2008-12-03 14:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5102084, 739220, 39427, '<td valign="top">cool shot, interesting composition, but rather "average" for a "master''s challenge" - Hope that doesn''t offend :D, 7</td>', 'cool shot, interesting composition, but rather "average" for a "master''s challenge" - Hope that doesn''t offend :D, 7', '2008-12-03 14:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5102086, 743463, 39427, '<td valign="top">strange and interesting</td>', 'strange and interesting', '2008-12-03 14:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
