(5102185, 738296, 39427, '<td valign="top">I recognize this!... could be Lord of the Rings, eh?  Has the feeling of epic-ness, nice work</td>', 'I recognize this!... could be Lord of the Rings, eh?  Has the feeling of epic-ness, nice work', '2008-12-03 14:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5102190, 742818, 39427, '<td valign="top">grainy &amp; pixelated on my screen... could also use some contrast?</td>', 'grainy & pixelated on my screen... could also use some contrast?', '2008-12-03 14:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5102193, 743544, 39427, '<td valign="top">a bit too washed out and grainy on my monitor</td>', 'a bit too washed out and grainy on my monitor', '2008-12-03 14:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5102194, 739636, 55956, '<td valign="top">for me this photo is a little masterpiece. You have conjugated two strong things, the simbol of the cross that always is a strong simbol and the black and white that is the best expression of the emotive photography. the composition is excellent, the models have a great expression. the overexposed whites of the snow and the sky whit a little grey and a little vignetting are a great contour of the image. well done the blacks. really a strong photo. I don''t know if this will be apreciated as it well deserve. 10</td>', 'for me this photo is a little masterpiece. You have conjugated two strong things, the simbol of the cross that always is a strong simbol and the black and white that is the best expression of the emotive photography. the composition is excellent, the models have a great expression. the overexposed whites of the snow and the sky whit a little grey and a little vignetting are a great contour of the image. well done the blacks. really a strong photo. I don''t know if this will be apreciated as it well deserve. 10', '2008-12-03 14:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
