(5102975, 743376, 34192, '<td valign="top">I don''t think this image was improved with the conversion to near black and white. The composition works well, the image appears sharp and in focus; I''m not sure why you sucked the color out. 5</td>', 'I don''t think this image was improved with the conversion to near black and white. The composition works well, the image appears sharp and in focus; I''m not sure why you sucked the color out. 5', '2008-12-03 18:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5102980, 743436, 34192, '<td valign="top">For me, there is no naturalness to this image - it looks more like a painting than a photograph.  But with a painting, the composition can be better controlled.  The tones and hues here are nice, but not enough to overcome the shortfalls of hyper-editing, flat lighting, and static composition.  Sorry!  I will say that the details in the grass really help. 5</td>', 'For me, there is no naturalness to this image - it looks more like a painting than a photograph.  But with a painting, the composition can be better controlled.  The tones and hues here are nice, but not enough to overcome the shortfalls of hyper-editing, flat lighting, and static composition.  Sorry!  I will say that the details in the grass really help. 5', '2008-12-03 18:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
