(5103928, 742699, 54478, '<td valign="top">Great photo. I wish the waves in the sand were more prominent (I know you can''t do much about that), but I also wish the flowers plant was a little more in focus. The top of the plan just doesn''t feel sharp.</td>', 'Great photo. I wish the waves in the sand were more prominent (I know you can''t do much about that), but I also wish the flowers plant was a little more in focus. The top of the plan just doesn''t feel sharp.', '2008-12-03 22:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
