(5103944, 741010, 54478, '<td valign="top">Very cute. Before I read your title I was like, "it''s mocking you!". Hehe...</td>', 'Very cute. Before I read your title I was like, "it''s mocking you!". Hehe...', '2008-12-03 22:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
