(5103977, 743639, 54478, '<td valign="top">The motion blur gives the bird a violent landing feeling. Like its going to be smashed to the ground for some reason. Neat photo.</td>', 'The motion blur gives the bird a violent landing feeling. Like its going to be smashed to the ground for some reason. Neat photo.', '2008-12-03 22:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
