(5104409, 738553, 99993, '<td valign="top">Great capture and great subject. What a photogenic bird! I wish they lived in the U.K!</td>', 'Great capture and great subject. What a photogenic bird! I wish they lived in the U.K!', '2008-12-04 03:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
