(5105043, 737982, 49773, '<td valign="top">I know this subject very well. You can take a look here&gt; //www.dpchallenge.com/portfolio.php?USER_ID=49773&amp;collection_id=31019<br/> <br/>I usually don''t comment on technical aspects of a photograph, <br/>BUT, I think that you overedited this, otherwise, very compelling scene. You tried to make it look "pretty", but don''t get me wrong- pretty in that eyecandy way. With a subject like this I''d prefer it to look more natural and less "bigger than life". Otherwise, you captured a wonderful moment.</td>', 'I know this subject very well. You can take a look here> //www.dpchallenge.com/portfolio.php?USER_ID=49773&collection_id=31019 I usually don''t comment on technical aspects of a photograph, BUT, I think that you overedited this, otherwise, very compelling scene. You tried to make it look "pretty", but don''t get me wrong- pretty in that eyecandy way. With a subject like this I''d prefer it to look more natural and less "bigger than life". Otherwise, you captured a wonderful moment.', '2008-12-04 09:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5105049, 739931, 70375, '<td valign="top">Merry Christmas! I always think of the holidays when I see a cardinal. Wonderful happenstance shot. I am really liking the water in little lines instead of frozen in place too :) He has some drops on his feathers under his chin too! Wonderful!</td>', 'Merry Christmas! I always think of the holidays when I see a cardinal. Wonderful happenstance shot. I am really liking the water in little lines instead of frozen in place too :) He has some drops on his feathers under his chin too! Wonderful!', '2008-12-04 09:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
