(5105512, 743720, 32767, '<td valign="top">Great title! It''s an effective shot. Hope you do well.</td>', 'Great title! It''s an effective shot. Hope you do well.', '2008-12-04 11:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5105514, 742984, 70375, '<td valign="top">This is the new London bridge, no? Very nicely captured and I like the way you got rid of the annoying cars that are always mucking up the shots. I am not a huge fan of extreme tilts like this, but here it works well. I feel like London bridge is falling down :) hehe</td>', 'This is the new London bridge, no? Very nicely captured and I like the way you got rid of the annoying cars that are always mucking up the shots. I am not a huge fan of extreme tilts like this, but here it works well. I feel like London bridge is falling down :) hehe', '2008-12-04 11:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5105520, 743544, 70375, '<td valign="top">This is just a tad too busy with no central subject for me. Your colours are a bit washed out but at least it is all in focus.</td>', 'This is just a tad too busy with no central subject for me. Your colours are a bit washed out but at least it is all in focus.', '2008-12-04 11:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5105523, 743257, 32767, '<td valign="top">Cool looking but no terribly original. I''ve seen too many of these shots to get any jump from them but it does have a nice abstract feel.</td>', 'Cool looking but no terribly original. I''ve seen too many of these shots to get any jump from them but it does have a nice abstract feel.', '2008-12-04 11:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5105533, 743090, 70375, '<td valign="top">Lions are tricky folk to work with, I imagine. If you tell them to turn left or right, they might bite your head off :) That said, I have NO idea how you got him to stand still for the one sided lighting you have going on here. This is beautiful and strikes a very sad feeling in me for some reason. I do wish I could see the eye on the right side and the noisy mane in the bottom right corner distracts my eye a bit. But, all in all nicely done.</td>', 'Lions are tricky folk to work with, I imagine. If you tell them to turn left or right, they might bite your head off :) That said, I have NO idea how you got him to stand still for the one sided lighting you have going on here. This is beautiful and strikes a very sad feeling in me for some reason. I do wish I could see the eye on the right side and the noisy mane in the bottom right corner distracts my eye a bit. But, all in all nicely done.', '2008-12-04 11:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5105538, 742642, 70375, '<td valign="top">This is very pretty but just a tad too small. It might be the added border that makes it seem so but is this 720px wide? Nice focus and colour.</td>', 'This is very pretty but just a tad too small. It might be the added border that makes it seem so but is this 720px wide? Nice focus and colour.', '2008-12-04 11:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5105541, 743578, 70375, '<td valign="top">I have no idea how you did this but no matter where I begin looking at the image, I am drawn back to the man and the center. Cool effect.</td>', 'I have no idea how you did this but no matter where I begin looking at the image, I am drawn back to the man and the center. Cool effect.', '2008-12-04 11:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5105550, 742897, 70375, '<td valign="top">OMGOMG!!! SO cute!! I wanna squeeze his fluffy bear cheeks! :) Wonderful job not losing any part of the bear in all that white. Beautiful and instant fave! :)</td>', 'OMGOMG!!! SO cute!! I wanna squeeze his fluffy bear cheeks! :) Wonderful job not losing any part of the bear in all that white. Beautiful and instant fave! :)', '2008-12-04 11:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5105553, 743226, 70375, '<td valign="top">Are you kidding me? Was this guy seriously in the middle of the road!!!??? What an opportune capture! Excellent example of street photography.</td>', 'Are you kidding me? Was this guy seriously in the middle of the road!!!??? What an opportune capture! Excellent example of street photography.', '2008-12-04 11:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5105558, 743220, 70375, '<td valign="top">I don''t really know how to comment this. This image is just so busy. I like the complimentary colours but my eye is left wandering all over the place. I can''t decide where to look.</td>', 'I don''t really know how to comment this. This image is just so busy. I like the complimentary colours but my eye is left wandering all over the place. I can''t decide where to look.', '2008-12-04 11:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5105572, 742392, 70375, '<td valign="top">That snail looks like a unicorn. I am loving that I can see a little face in the critter as well. A very elegant looking face. Must be a she :) Nice capture! Perfect focus, lovely DOF, great clarity, stunning composition. Great job!</td>', 'That snail looks like a unicorn. I am loving that I can see a little face in the critter as well. A very elegant looking face. Must be a she :) Nice capture! Perfect focus, lovely DOF, great clarity, stunning composition. Great job!', '2008-12-04 11:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5105577, 739513, 70375, '<td valign="top">Great pp. This one falls a bit crooked on my eye though. Might be the way the water is laid out in the photograph... dunno. Beautiful colours and light though. Good luck :)</td>', 'Great pp. This one falls a bit crooked on my eye though. Might be the way the water is laid out in the photograph... dunno. Beautiful colours and light though. Good luck :)', '2008-12-04 11:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5105641, 742818, 40718, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, although I believe from the noise it was a severe crop.  Good capture of the eyes.  I like the yellows of his chest. 6</td>', 'Nice composition, although I believe from the noise it was a severe crop.  Good capture of the eyes.  I like the yellows of his chest. 6', '2008-12-04 12:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5105646, 743675, 40718, '<td valign="top">Ooh. I love this waterfall.  I only got there once though and not from this angle.  It''s a nice one.  I love the greens of the water, but the ferns are a bit crazy.  I do love to shift the hues to rich greens, but I wonder if you pushed beyond a bit here.  I miss the Gorge. :( 7</td>', 'Ooh. I love this waterfall.  I only got there once though and not from this angle.  It''s a nice one.  I love the greens of the water, but the ferns are a bit crazy.  I do love to shift the hues to rich greens, but I wonder if you pushed beyond a bit here.  I miss the Gorge. :( 7', '2008-12-04 12:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5105649, 743585, 40718, '<td valign="top">Very sweet.  nicely captured with his/her eyes open. 7</td>', 'Very sweet.  nicely captured with his/her eyes open. 7', '2008-12-04 12:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5105654, 743452, 40718, '<td valign="top">tough exposure.  You did well on the water, but the bird obviously blew out a bit.  The reds are overdone, at least on this monitor.  I do like the action.  You just want to know what the bird is going after. 5</td>', 'tough exposure.  You did well on the water, but the bird obviously blew out a bit.  The reds are overdone, at least on this monitor.  I do like the action.  You just want to know what the bird is going after. 5', '2008-12-04 12:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5105661, 743463, 40718, '<td valign="top">I like the blur you added.  At least I''m assuming that''s mainly PP blur, but it could be a filter.  The strong lighting works in this picture. 7</td>', 'I like the blur you added.  At least I''m assuming that''s mainly PP blur, but it could be a filter.  The strong lighting works in this picture. 7', '2008-12-04 12:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5105668, 743631, 40718, '<td valign="top">Very nicely lit.  I have to say as soon as I caught the sort of strange look to her right arm (probably due to the exact pose/angle) my eye can''t get away from it.  The pose looks just a bit "hunched" to me, but I''ve seen that pose before and perhaps that''s what you were going for.  Overall nicely done. 7</td>', 'Very nicely lit.  I have to say as soon as I caught the sort of strange look to her right arm (probably due to the exact pose/angle) my eye can''t get away from it.  The pose looks just a bit "hunched" to me, but I''ve seen that pose before and perhaps that''s what you were going for.  Overall nicely done. 7', '2008-12-04 12:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5105675, 743436, 40718, '<td valign="top">I very much like the yellows you brought out in the grass.  They go nicely with the blues of the water.  I would have been tempted to clone out the barn just because it''s exactly behind the tree.  If it were more separate, then I''d keep it indeed as it adds a splash of color. 7</td>', 'I very much like the yellows you brought out in the grass.  They go nicely with the blues of the water.  I would have been tempted to clone out the barn just because it''s exactly behind the tree.  If it were more separate, then I''d keep it indeed as it adds a splash of color. 7', '2008-12-04 12:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5105677, 743249, 40718, '<td valign="top">Nicely lit and controlled.  She looks just a tad too posed IMO, but that''s a nitpick.  If I were her, I''d be very pleased with this portrait. 7</td>', 'Nicely lit and controlled.  She looks just a tad too posed IMO, but that''s a nitpick.  If I were her, I''d be very pleased with this portrait. 7', '2008-12-04 12:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5105686, 743303, 40718, '<td valign="top">Well, this must be bear.  Ya, I can see how some much complain about the oranges.  This monitor at work isn''t bad, but it isn''t calibrated either and the oranges are pixellating somewhat, especially on the right bank highlight.  Classic composition.  8</td>', 'Well, this must be bear.  Ya, I can see how some much complain about the oranges.  This monitor at work isn''t bad, but it isn''t calibrated either and the oranges are pixellating somewhat, especially on the right bank highlight.  Classic composition.  8', '2008-12-04 12:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5105694, 741834, 40718, '<td valign="top">Damselflies are fun to shoot.  I wish we got just a bit more detail in the eyes, but that''s probably your lens and not your fault.  The colors are briliant.  The "scratching arm" is a neat touch. 7</td>', 'Damselflies are fun to shoot.  I wish we got just a bit more detail in the eyes, but that''s probably your lens and not your fault.  The colors are briliant.  The "scratching arm" is a neat touch. 7', '2008-12-04 12:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5105700, 743483, 40718, '<td valign="top">A quaint scene.  I do like the long shadow from the lamppost.  At least on this monitor the blacks are muddy among the buildings which hurts the shot.  Perhaps a S/H treatment would have helped a tad. 5</td>', 'A quaint scene.  I do like the long shadow from the lamppost.  At least on this monitor the blacks are muddy among the buildings which hurts the shot.  Perhaps a S/H treatment would have helped a tad. 5', '2008-12-04 12:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5105705, 743399, 40718, '<td valign="top">I like the arrangement of smokestacks.  I wish there was just a bit more luminosity in the sky.  Perhaps shooting earlier in the evening? 6</td>', 'I like the arrangement of smokestacks.  I wish there was just a bit more luminosity in the sky.  Perhaps shooting earlier in the evening? 6', '2008-12-04 12:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5105711, 742696, 40718, '<td valign="top">Lots of classic blue/orange combos in this challenge.  This is a nice scene.  The colors may be pushed a tiny bit too far.  I think I see some pixellation showing up, especially on the left among the large bushes.  Great clouds in the shot. 7</td>', 'Lots of classic blue/orange combos in this challenge.  This is a nice scene.  The colors may be pushed a tiny bit too far.  I think I see some pixellation showing up, especially on the left among the large bushes.  Great clouds in the shot. 7', '2008-12-04 12:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5105718, 743054, 40718, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately the hue shift didn''t treat your highlights well.  I think the eye finds colors more appealing when there are true blacks and whites.</td>', 'Unfortunately the hue shift didn''t treat your highlights well.  I think the eye finds colors more appealing when there are true blacks and whites.', '2008-12-04 12:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5105719, 742319, 40718, '<td valign="top">Nice pleasing magentas and purples.  The shot works pretty well as an abstract.  If I could magically recompose things I might have gone for a narrower, taller canvas size and moved the water ring down just a tad, but I realize that might be making the shot into MY picture and not YOUR picture. 7</td>', 'Nice pleasing magentas and purples.  The shot works pretty well as an abstract.  If I could magically recompose things I might have gone for a narrower, taller canvas size and moved the water ring down just a tad, but I realize that might be making the shot into MY picture and not YOUR picture. 7', '2008-12-04 12:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5105722, 742763, 40718, '<td valign="top">Very cute captured expression.  Looks like a slightly faster shutter speed would have helped as we have what looks like motion blur most apparent at the bottom. 5</td>', 'Very cute captured expression.  Looks like a slightly faster shutter speed would have helped as we have what looks like motion blur most apparent at the bottom. 5', '2008-12-04 12:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5105780, 743341, 88136, '<td valign="top">oh what a great photo. the texture, the eye of the mom, the cuteness of the little dude. excellent-8</td>', 'oh what a great photo. the texture, the eye of the mom, the cuteness of the little dude. excellent-8', '2008-12-04 12:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
