(5105788, 739882, 88136, '<td valign="top">this just isnt really grabbing me. i like the detail in the granules of pollen though. maybe the lighting is whats getting to me</td>', 'this just isnt really grabbing me. i like the detail in the granules of pollen though. maybe the lighting is whats getting to me', '2008-12-04 12:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
