(5105792, 743445, 88136, '<td valign="top">wow. this is one of my favorite photos so far in the challenge. the color is freaking amazing, as is the perfect reflection. the rock in the foreground just MAKES this photo. good job!-9</td>', 'wow. this is one of my favorite photos so far in the challenge. the color is freaking amazing, as is the perfect reflection. the rock in the foreground just MAKES this photo. good job!-9', '2008-12-04 12:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
