(5105801, 743376, 88136, '<td valign="top">what a beautiful animal. if its a snow leopard, why did you do it in black and white? i dunno, this ones comfusing me a bit</td>', 'what a beautiful animal. if its a snow leopard, why did you do it in black and white? i dunno, this ones comfusing me a bit', '2008-12-04 12:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5105805, 743665, 88136, '<td valign="top">wow. this is lovely! i really like the leaf over on the right hand side of the photo, its glinty-ness is amazing. it really parallels the color in the waterfall</td>', 'wow. this is lovely! i really like the leaf over on the right hand side of the photo, its glinty-ness is amazing. it really parallels the color in the waterfall', '2008-12-04 12:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
