(5105811, 741834, 88136, '<td valign="top">OMG thats so freaking awesome! congrats on such an excellent photo! ahhh!!! this better ribbon!!!</td>', 'OMG thats so freaking awesome! congrats on such an excellent photo! ahhh!!! this better ribbon!!!', '2008-12-04 12:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5105821, 742210, 63398, '<td valign="top">An incredible technical masterpiece with stellar composition for the artistic palate. REALLY like this! Fav &amp; 9</td>', 'An incredible technical masterpiece with stellar composition for the artistic palate. REALLY like this! Fav & 9', '2008-12-04 13:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5105826, 742637, 63398, '<td valign="top">This is excellent from a technique and quality standpoint. What makes it really stand out to me is the suggested message of some dark ritual captured. It''s unnervingly well done. 9</td>', 'This is excellent from a technique and quality standpoint. What makes it really stand out to me is the suggested message of some dark ritual captured. It''s unnervingly well done. 9', '2008-12-04 13:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5105858, 742353, 63398, '<td valign="top">Sublime. Serene. Lovely. Just a sheer delight to view. 8</td>', 'Sublime. Serene. Lovely. Just a sheer delight to view. 8', '2008-12-04 13:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5105862, 743192, 63398, '<td valign="top">I truly like this image very much. I hate the letterbox format thing, but that''s a peronal quirk. Very nicely capture.......lightning is extraordinarily hard to catch. 8</td>', 'I truly like this image very much. I hate the letterbox format thing, but that''s a peronal quirk. Very nicely capture.......lightning is extraordinarily hard to catch. 8', '2008-12-04 13:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5105871, 741807, 63398, '<td valign="top">HATE the letterbox framing.......it makes me feel like I''m being deprived of some of the image. An exquisite portrait of an exceptionally nice expression. Excellent processing. Truly nice work! 8</td>', 'HATE the letterbox framing.......it makes me feel like I''m being deprived of some of the image. An exquisite portrait of an exceptionally nice expression. Excellent processing. Truly nice work! 8', '2008-12-04 13:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5105874, 743376, 63398, '<td valign="top">Excellent framing &amp; detail.....wonderful subject. I would not have thought this would have looked this fine in B&amp;W. 8</td>', 'Excellent framing & detail.....wonderful subject. I would not have thought this would have looked this fine in B&W. 8', '2008-12-04 13:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5105877, 742969, 63398, '<td valign="top">Love the sharpened color in this lightly tone-mapped/HDR image. Good job of capturing a gritty edge with the technique. Love the mood. Title is just too cute. 8</td>', 'Love the sharpened color in this lightly tone-mapped/HDR image. Good job of capturing a gritty edge with the technique. Love the mood. Title is just too cute. 8', '2008-12-04 13:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5105879, 740891, 63398, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful. It''s almost too perfect on some levels.....there''s nothing that grabs me as I would expect an image of this gorgeous young woman should. still......a lovely and clean portrait. 8</td>', 'Very beautiful. It''s almost too perfect on some levels.....there''s nothing that grabs me as I would expect an image of this gorgeous young woman should. still......a lovely and clean portrait. 8', '2008-12-04 13:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5105880, 741898, 63398, '<td valign="top">Really like this river scene. Terrific job, terrific find/capture. 8</td>', 'Really like this river scene. Terrific job, terrific find/capture. 8', '2008-12-04 13:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5105883, 742702, 63398, '<td valign="top">An extremely provocative image.....who is she? What is she up to? Very thought-provoking and pleasing to the eye. 8</td>', 'An extremely provocative image.....who is she? What is she up to? Very thought-provoking and pleasing to the eye. 8', '2008-12-04 13:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5105888, 743462, 63398, '<td valign="top">I guess I understand why people gripe.....there''s nothing that really makes this stand out from the hundreds of other spectacular sunset on the rocky coast images.....8&gt;) Nice! 8</td>', 'I guess I understand why people gripe.....there''s nothing that really makes this stand out from the hundreds of other spectacular sunset on the rocky coast images.....8>) Nice! 8', '2008-12-04 13:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5105984, 743617, 30791, '<td valign="top">this is probobly the best photo on DPC ive ever seen. The idea reminds me of Jorge DeSousa''s photo of the last supper. 10 from me</td>', 'this is probobly the best photo on DPC ive ever seen. The idea reminds me of Jorge DeSousa''s photo of the last supper. 10 from me', '2008-12-04 14:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5105987, 742637, 30791, '<td valign="top">I cant wait to see where this is so i can visit<br/>Great theme and lighting</td>', 'I cant wait to see where this is so i can visitGreat theme and lighting', '2008-12-04 14:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5106018, 740041, 62187, '<td valign="top">To me, the camera work is that of a ''Master''. The subject matter is very artistic, the tilt and composition is perfect. I like the sepia, it''s makes a great mood for a touching photo. This is a photo that almost doesn''t need a title but is good that you did for the people that won''t really look at the photo. Excellent: 10</td>', 'To me, the camera work is that of a ''Master''. The subject matter is very artistic, the tilt and composition is perfect. I like the sepia, it''s makes a great mood for a touching photo. This is a photo that almost doesn''t need a title but is good that you did for the people that won''t really look at the photo. Excellent: 10', '2008-12-04 14:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5106043, 743436, 62187, '<td valign="top">Kind of ''Cartoon-ish'' looking to me, but I like it. I think the photo would have been perfect if the barn or whatever the red thing is were not positioned behind the top of the tree. I was going to rate it at 9 but the 3D look is very cool to me. Very cool indeed...burrr! 10</td>', 'Kind of ''Cartoon-ish'' looking to me, but I like it. I think the photo would have been perfect if the barn or whatever the red thing is were not positioned behind the top of the tree. I was going to rate it at 9 but the 3D look is very cool to me. Very cool indeed...burrr! 10', '2008-12-04 14:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5106055, 743292, 62187, '<td valign="top">Looks like some building we''ve seen recently - maybe not. Burr...looks like a cold, drab and isolated place. I wish I was there. To me, the ''Centered'' look is not so appealing. However, being off-set by the barn (?) in the distance balances it out. I like the vignette look in this: 10</td>', 'Looks like some building we''ve seen recently - maybe not. Burr...looks like a cold, drab and isolated place. I wish I was there. To me, the ''Centered'' look is not so appealing. However, being off-set by the barn (?) in the distance balances it out. I like the vignette look in this: 10', '2008-12-04 14:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5106061, 743382, 62187, '<td valign="top">Very crisp and clear. I''ll never get this look with my city so I am drawn to this type of reflection: 10</td>', 'Very crisp and clear. I''ll never get this look with my city so I am drawn to this type of reflection: 10', '2008-12-04 14:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5106066, 738553, 62187, '<td valign="top">The detail is very sharp and how could I give this bird anything less then a 10.</td>', 'The detail is very sharp and how could I give this bird anything less then a 10.', '2008-12-04 14:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5106071, 742392, 62187, '<td valign="top">It''s not very attractive to me but certainly a well done photo: that of a true masters work. 10</td>', 'It''s not very attractive to me but certainly a well done photo: that of a true masters work. 10', '2008-12-04 14:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5106074, 743116, 62187, '<td valign="top">I don''t really care for the photo but it''s not about personal taste is it? Other then being centered the photo is perfect and it''s totally 3D to me: 10</td>', 'I don''t really care for the photo but it''s not about personal taste is it? Other then being centered the photo is perfect and it''s totally 3D to me: 10', '2008-12-04 14:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5106079, 743422, 62187, '<td valign="top">Nothing really jumps out at me but it is a well done photo: very sharp and crisp and the reflection is very nice as well as the composition. 10</td>', 'Nothing really jumps out at me but it is a well done photo: very sharp and crisp and the reflection is very nice as well as the composition. 10', '2008-12-04 14:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
