(5106092, 737872, 62187, '<td valign="top">Excellent set-up and not just a random ''snap-shot'' of a pretty place where nature did all the real work. To me, this looks like the work of a True Master. Good luck to you: 10</td>', 'Excellent set-up and not just a random ''snap-shot'' of a pretty place where nature did all the real work. To me, this looks like the work of a True Master. Good luck to you: 10', '2008-12-04 14:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5106097, 743682, 62187, '<td valign="top">Very appealing. Nice work on the sky - where many photos have noise: yours does not. Not that I can see anyway. 10</td>', 'Very appealing. Nice work on the sky - where many photos have noise: yours does not. Not that I can see anyway. 10', '2008-12-04 14:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
