(5106170, 740662, 62187, '<td valign="top">I smoked for 28 years and quit 9 months ago. I shouldn''t nag to people who do so I won''t. And besides, this is about photography huh!?!?! So...10!</td>', 'I smoked for 28 years and quit 9 months ago. I shouldn''t nag to people who do so I won''t. And besides, this is about photography huh!?!?! So...10!', '2008-12-04 15:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
