(5106791, 737191, 42013, '<td valign="top">Love the little bowlers pose. Just waitin'' for the sprinkle of pins to go flying. 9</td>', 'Love the little bowlers pose. Just waitin'' for the sprinkle of pins to go flying. 9', '2008-12-04 19:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5106792, 743639, 42013, '<td valign="top">Blur doesn''t work for me on most levels-- but, this is different in that there is just enough here that my mind fills in all of the gaps, or tries to. Looks like some panning along with the longer shutter speed. Effective image...likely to score middle of the pack and pick up some favs along the way. Cheers!</td>', 'Blur doesn''t work for me on most levels-- but, this is different in that there is just enough here that my mind fills in all of the gaps, or tries to. Looks like some panning along with the longer shutter speed. Effective image...likely to score middle of the pack and pick up some favs along the way. Cheers!', '2008-12-04 19:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5106797, 743667, 42013, '<td valign="top">Really well done-- subtle and beautiful. Must have been a joy to be there. 10</td>', 'Really well done-- subtle and beautiful. Must have been a joy to be there. 10', '2008-12-04 19:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5106798, 743617, 42013, '<td valign="top">Would make a nice addition to Jorge''s ''Last Supper''.</td>', 'Would make a nice addition to Jorge''s ''Last Supper''.', '2008-12-04 19:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5106933, 738279, 93543, '<td valign="top">Incredible. 10.</td>', 'Incredible. 10.', '2008-12-04 20:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5106968, 743291, 87808, '<td valign="top">haunting 10</td>', 'haunting 10', '2008-12-04 20:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5106992, 743480, 15643, '<td valign="top">The composition of this shot is AMAZING! I love the colors, I love the glow off the chairs and I love the stained glass. Unfortuatly I think this image is let down by the lack of a wider angle. The ceiling is leading you on and wants to be looked at, but is cut short. So i think if you do this shot again you should focus on the chairs or the ceiling, not both. 7</td>', 'The composition of this shot is AMAZING! I love the colors, I love the glow off the chairs and I love the stained glass. Unfortuatly I think this image is let down by the lack of a wider angle. The ceiling is leading you on and wants to be looked at, but is cut short. So i think if you do this shot again you should focus on the chairs or the ceiling, not both. 7', '2008-12-04 20:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5106999, 738279, 15643, '<td valign="top">Great high contrast black and white, but having the reflections cut off makes it look awkward. Same thing with the top right of the bridge being cut off. Idk if this was a result of croping, or a lack of a wider lens. Nonetheless, great composition. 6</td>', 'Great high contrast black and white, but having the reflections cut off makes it look awkward. Same thing with the top right of the bridge being cut off. Idk if this was a result of croping, or a lack of a wider lens. Nonetheless, great composition. 6', '2008-12-04 20:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5107010, 742202, 15643, '<td valign="top">Absolutly beautiful coloring here. I like the speia-but-somehow-not look. Not much of a fan of the framing; I would like to see this in thirds. Great model. 6</td>', 'Absolutly beautiful coloring here. I like the speia-but-somehow-not look. Not much of a fan of the framing; I would like to see this in thirds. Great model. 6', '2008-12-04 20:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5107019, 743058, 15643, '<td valign="top">Great macro of a spider and what looks like a leaf. The subject is great, and the lighting is even better, how it reflects off the water. I especially like the dimples created by the feet. However, the focus is a bit soft for my likings. This is a small subject, with great detail and should be shown as such. But then again, it could be my monitor. 6</td>', 'Great macro of a spider and what looks like a leaf. The subject is great, and the lighting is even better, how it reflects off the water. I especially like the dimples created by the feet. However, the focus is a bit soft for my likings. This is a small subject, with great detail and should be shown as such. But then again, it could be my monitor. 6', '2008-12-04 20:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5107032, 737982, 15643, '<td valign="top">Amazing dichotomy shot! I love the sharp black and white detail in this image, and the children in this shot just sell it. I also like how you were able to keep the reflections in the eyes under control. Nothing bad to say about this image. 8</td>', 'Amazing dichotomy shot! I love the sharp black and white detail in this image, and the children in this shot just sell it. I also like how you were able to keep the reflections in the eyes under control. Nothing bad to say about this image. 8', '2008-12-04 20:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5107045, 743600, 15643, '<td valign="top">Nice Shallow DOF on this shot, and it works well with the subject. My main dislike with this shot is the centerd framing, and the leaf in the foreground. I think a SDOF image should have the subject be in the foreground to avoid having blurry stuff in front being a distraction. 4</td>', 'Nice Shallow DOF on this shot, and it works well with the subject. My main dislike with this shot is the centerd framing, and the leaf in the foreground. I think a SDOF image should have the subject be in the foreground to avoid having blurry stuff in front being a distraction. 4', '2008-12-04 20:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5107052, 743772, 15643, '<td valign="top">Usually the "self portrait" challenges makes people cringe, but you did one in a free study; impressive! The B&amp;W works well this this shot, it makes it look very crisp. The lighting is great with no harsh shadows or uneven lighting and the glint off the earing is a plus. If i had to give criticism, I would say that its not the most "original" shot. 6</td>', 'Usually the "self portrait" challenges makes people cringe, but you did one in a free study; impressive! The B&W works well this this shot, it makes it look very crisp. The lighting is great with no harsh shadows or uneven lighting and the glint off the earing is a plus. If i had to give criticism, I would say that its not the most "original" shot. 6', '2008-12-04 21:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5107058, 743090, 15643, '<td valign="top">You must have a great zoo, or a connection there to get this shot! I like how you went about with the lighting, but I really wish we could see the other eye! So maybe a bit too harsh on the shadowing. The fur, however, has great detail, and i like how it fills the frame. 6</td>', 'You must have a great zoo, or a connection there to get this shot! I like how you went about with the lighting, but I really wish we could see the other eye! So maybe a bit too harsh on the shadowing. The fur, however, has great detail, and i like how it fills the frame. 6', '2008-12-04 21:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5107077, 743617, 15643, '<td valign="top">WOW! Took me a few minutes to even look at everything that is going on with this. This is my favorite idea of all of them so far, just because of the originality to it. The modern theme is just so well executed. Every detail is there: The parametics have all their gear, as do the firefighters. The smoke adds great drama to the scene, and the women in dresses show so much emotion! I also like how we cant see the firefighters'' faces, and how the girl in the paramedic is calling on the radio. If I had to search through and pick out a little detail i dont like its this: It would look better outside, but i know that would be close to impossible to keep the same lighting. Great job! 9</td>', 'WOW! Took me a few minutes to even look at everything that is going on with this. This is my favorite idea of all of them so far, just because of the originality to it. The modern theme is just so well executed. Every detail is there: The parametics have all their gear, as do the firefighters. The smoke adds great drama to the scene, and the women in dresses show so much emotion! I also like how we cant see the firefighters'' faces, and how the girl in the paramedic is calling on the radio. If I had to search through and pick out a little detail i dont like its this: It would look better outside, but i know that would be close to impossible to keep the same lighting. Great job! 9', '2008-12-04 21:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5107084, 742210, 43774, '<td valign="top">What impresses me most about this image is how clean the glass is....not a drop of water on it, no smudges at all. Attention to detail is amazing.</td>', 'What impresses me most about this image is how clean the glass is....not a drop of water on it, no smudges at all. Attention to detail is amazing.', '2008-12-04 21:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5107087, 739636, 43774, '<td valign="top">Talk about surreal! WOW!</td>', 'Talk about surreal! WOW!', '2008-12-04 21:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5107089, 743193, 43774, '<td valign="top">Pretty, very pretty.</td>', 'Pretty, very pretty.', '2008-12-04 21:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5107114, 743226, 49773, '<td valign="top">Very peculiar, nice find!</td>', 'Very peculiar, nice find!', '2008-12-04 21:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5107148, 738990, 78021, '<td valign="top">Bit too soft for my liking.</td>', 'Bit too soft for my liking.', '2008-12-04 21:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5107165, 742637, 78021, '<td valign="top">Spooky lighting, so evenly lit, but only in the foreground, and very few shadows.  Makes it look like a painting.  I like.</td>', 'Spooky lighting, so evenly lit, but only in the foreground, and very few shadows.  Makes it look like a painting.  I like.', '2008-12-04 21:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5107174, 741864, 78021, '<td valign="top">clever!</td>', 'clever!', '2008-12-04 21:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5107183, 743720, 49773, '<td valign="top">Amen.</td>', 'Amen.', '2008-12-04 21:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5107197, 738990, 53814, '<td valign="top">5.5 or not, this is a great shot Andi...</td>', '5.5 or not, this is a great shot Andi...', '2008-12-04 22:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5107386, 738060, 15643, '<td valign="top">Oh fun image! I love the patterns in the tile work and the curves of the railings. The asemmetry works great with this image, and the splashes of color from the plants are great. Did you have to add lighting on the bottom floor by the plant? My only issue is the framing of the closest bars, i would like to have seen it centered on the middle bar or centered in the middle of the bars. 6</td>', 'Oh fun image! I love the patterns in the tile work and the curves of the railings. The asemmetry works great with this image, and the splashes of color from the plants are great. Did you have to add lighting on the bottom floor by the plant? My only issue is the framing of the closest bars, i would like to have seen it centered on the middle bar or centered in the middle of the bars. 6', '2008-12-04 23:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5107401, 741864, 15643, '<td valign="top">Haha! a 10 for creativity and originality for sure. However I would not concider this a breathtaking photograph, and think it would do better in a specific challenge as opposed to a free study. My suggestion would have been to line up a lot more motherboards and such and take the picture at a lower angle to got closer to the action. This way you could take advantage of a shallow DOF for effect. Great idea though, and well executed! 5</td>', 'Haha! a 10 for creativity and originality for sure. However I would not concider this a breathtaking photograph, and think it would do better in a specific challenge as opposed to a free study. My suggestion would have been to line up a lot more motherboards and such and take the picture at a lower angle to got closer to the action. This way you could take advantage of a shallow DOF for effect. Great idea though, and well executed! 5', '2008-12-04 23:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5107412, 741528, 62187, '<td valign="top">It looks like a very professional photo. Very sharp, almost too much. Something about the perspective of the so-called ''cigar'' is slightly askew to me otherwise I''d have rated your photo at 10. As is, I''ll go with a 9.</td>', 'It looks like a very professional photo. Very sharp, almost too much. Something about the perspective of the so-called ''cigar'' is slightly askew to me otherwise I''d have rated your photo at 10. As is, I''ll go with a 9.', '2008-12-04 23:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5107413, 743578, 15643, '<td valign="top">Great use of negative space in this photo. I really like the lighting and the gradual color change. If i were to offer criticism it would be two things: 1. Get rid of the watch and 2. Somehow dont show what i guess is the ground and rock under the water. Great idea, and great execution. 7</td>', 'Great use of negative space in this photo. I really like the lighting and the gradual color change. If i were to offer criticism it would be two things: 1. Get rid of the watch and 2. Somehow dont show what i guess is the ground and rock under the water. Great idea, and great execution. 7', '2008-12-04 23:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5107425, 735858, 15643, '<td valign="top">hmmm... Was this on purpose? Brown ribbon? Well if you arent going for the brown ribbon, I can only assume that you are trying to infer that the summer is fading away. If this was your intention, then it works well enough but it could use a lot of work. 3</td>', 'hmmm... Was this on purpose? Brown ribbon? Well if you arent going for the brown ribbon, I can only assume that you are trying to infer that the summer is fading away. If this was your intention, then it works well enough but it could use a lot of work. 3', '2008-12-04 23:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5107439, 743339, 15643, '<td valign="top">What a great location and scene. I really like the light comming through from behind the stilts. The contrasting red and blue work very well and the still water makes for great reflections. However, I dont think you used the reflectios of the water to their potential. I would like to see more of the structure reflected instead of just a little bit of the top. Everything else is great though.</td>', 'What a great location and scene. I really like the light comming through from behind the stilts. The contrasting red and blue work very well and the still water makes for great reflections. However, I dont think you used the reflectios of the water to their potential. I would like to see more of the structure reflected instead of just a little bit of the top. Everything else is great though.', '2008-12-04 23:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5107453, 743651, 38706, '<td valign="top">I love this one... great colours &amp; framing &amp; nice simple image.</td>', 'I love this one... great colours & framing & nice simple image.', '2008-12-04 23:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5107457, 743221, 38706, '<td valign="top">What a great portrait!  Engaged and detached at the same time.  Love the framing &amp; B&amp;W conversion.</td>', 'What a great portrait!  Engaged and detached at the same time.  Love the framing & B&W conversion.', '2008-12-04 23:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5107459, 739636, 38706, '<td valign="top">I love everything - the concept and the B&amp;W.... The vin on the top really works for this one.</td>', 'I love everything - the concept and the B&W.... The vin on the top really works for this one.', '2008-12-04 23:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5107467, 739879, 38706, '<td valign="top">Great timing on the wheel :-)</td>', 'Great timing on the wheel :-)', '2008-12-04 23:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5107486, 743466, 38706, '<td valign="top">Great use of shadow here....  I like the centre framing (although want he head closer to the middle of the window frame if I was picky).  Colours are great.</td>', 'Great use of shadow here....  I like the centre framing (although want he head closer to the middle of the window frame if I was picky).  Colours are great.', '2008-12-04 23:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5107503, 740686, 38706, '<td valign="top">Nicely engaged in this portrait....  Very nice.  The rounded square gives it a sort of retro feel which is good.</td>', 'Nicely engaged in this portrait....  Very nice.  The rounded square gives it a sort of retro feel which is good.', '2008-12-04 23:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5107508, 743463, 38706, '<td valign="top">Love the dream like quality to the focus areas.  Great job forcing the eye to the face!</td>', 'Love the dream like quality to the focus areas.  Great job forcing the eye to the face!', '2008-12-04 23:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5107528, 741568, 50695, '<td valign="top">Great effect!</td>', 'Great effect!', '2008-12-04 23:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5107531, 742815, 50695, '<td valign="top">Nice capture! The light is great.</td>', 'Nice capture! The light is great.', '2008-12-04 23:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5107562, 740734, 50695, '<td valign="top">stunning capture.</td>', 'stunning capture.', '2008-12-05 00:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5107565, 743636, 50695, '<td valign="top">Excellent concert capture.</td>', 'Excellent concert capture.', '2008-12-05 00:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5107577, 743174, 50695, '<td valign="top">This is buckety, perhaps too simple for bucket, but the quality of the light and the b/w processing is great. It''s also great how close she is to the edge of the frame and she looks out of it. There''s a lot of energy and rebellion in the composition.</td>', 'This is buckety, perhaps too simple for bucket, but the quality of the light and the b/w processing is great. It''s also great how close she is to the edge of the frame and she looks out of it. There''s a lot of energy and rebellion in the composition.', '2008-12-05 00:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5107581, 743222, 50695, '<td valign="top">Wonderful silhouette work. This photo dances with the girl.</td>', 'Wonderful silhouette work. This photo dances with the girl.', '2008-12-05 00:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5107583, 743544, 50695, '<td valign="top">Very nice treatment. I love the multitudes contained in this photograph. Hell, there''s even a boat!</td>', 'Very nice treatment. I love the multitudes contained in this photograph. Hell, there''s even a boat!', '2008-12-05 00:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5107584, 735858, 50695, '<td valign="top">Bravo for being so out of focus. It''s beautiful to look at. (bokeh pointillism)</td>', 'Bravo for being so out of focus. It''s beautiful to look at. (bokeh pointillism)', '2008-12-05 00:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5107586, 743152, 50695, '<td valign="top">I know this is supposed to be too slick for my taste, but I love this. It''s almost campy in its sharp perfection, and the integration of the artwork into her thoughts and dreams is very nicely done.</td>', 'I know this is supposed to be too slick for my taste, but I love this. It''s almost campy in its sharp perfection, and the integration of the artwork into her thoughts and dreams is very nicely done.', '2008-12-05 00:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
