(5107605, 743639, 50695, '<td valign="top">This is just wow. Sure, I''ve seen great bird shots before, but I''ve never seen *this* bird shot before. Posthumous Blue Ribbon for you.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg"/></td>', 'This is just wow. Sure, I''ve seen great bird shots before, but I''ve never seen *this* bird shot before. Posthumous Blue Ribbon for you. ', '2008-12-05 00:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5107609, 743720, 50695, '<td valign="top">wonderful, almost pure photography. a beautiful tribute. I give you my personal red ribbon.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/></td>', 'wonderful, almost pure photography. a beautiful tribute. I give you my personal red ribbon. ', '2008-12-05 00:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5107614, 743665, 50695, '<td valign="top">lovely twisting composition that draws me in and out and round and round. Wonderful tones, too. Quite an exquisite picture. I give you my Posthumous Yellow Ribbon.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg"/></td>', 'lovely twisting composition that draws me in and out and round and round. Wonderful tones, too. Quite an exquisite picture. I give you my Posthumous Yellow Ribbon. ', '2008-12-05 00:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
