(5108022, 738990, 23394, '<td valign="top">gorgeous.  most people don''t understand the art of the imperfect photo and throw these away.  to me, this is what the art of photography is all about.  thanks for entering this.</td>', 'gorgeous.  most people don''t understand the art of the imperfect photo and throw these away.  to me, this is what the art of photography is all about.  thanks for entering this.', '2008-12-05 06:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
