(5109325, 743257, 63269, '<td valign="top">I must admit that I personally am getting a little tired of these shots, but I imagine this was probably a lot of work to set up, and it is beautiful and nicely done.</td>', 'I must admit that I personally am getting a little tired of these shots, but I imagine this was probably a lot of work to set up, and it is beautiful and nicely done.', '2008-12-05 12:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
