(5109699, 743651, 67841, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for a good barbed wire shot - good luck...</td>', 'I''m a sucker for a good barbed wire shot - good luck...', '2008-12-05 14:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5109701, 743303, 18655, '<td valign="top">Excellent post-editing and composition. Love the position of the boat. 8</td>', 'Excellent post-editing and composition. Love the position of the boat. 8', '2008-12-05 14:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5109705, 742969, 18655, '<td valign="top">Love the post editing and the effect you achieved. Good job! 8</td>', 'Love the post editing and the effect you achieved. Good job! 8', '2008-12-05 14:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5109707, 743228, 67841, '<td valign="top">Excellent eagle shot - not easy to come by!  You''re lucky to have one whose chosen an accessible location as his favorite hangout :)</td>', 'Excellent eagle shot - not easy to come by!  You''re lucky to have one whose chosen an accessible location as his favorite hangout :)', '2008-12-05 14:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5109709, 743376, 67841, '<td valign="top">beautiful cat - good luck...</td>', 'beautiful cat - good luck...', '2008-12-05 14:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5109711, 743193, 18655, '<td valign="top">Looks great but was maybe looking for something else in the masters. This is more of a texture/stock image to me but well executed and good color choices. 7</td>', 'Looks great but was maybe looking for something else in the masters. This is more of a texture/stock image to me but well executed and good color choices. 7', '2008-12-05 14:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5109713, 743459, 67841, '<td valign="top">nice action - you don''t usually get to see a pic of swans engaged like this - good luck...</td>', 'nice action - you don''t usually get to see a pic of swans engaged like this - good luck...', '2008-12-05 14:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5109718, 742319, 18655, '<td valign="top">It almost looks like the the water reflects a different color that what the sky is. But it looks nice. Good choice with the splash. 6</td>', 'It almost looks like the the water reflects a different color that what the sky is. But it looks nice. Good choice with the splash. 6', '2008-12-05 14:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5109721, 742848, 18655, '<td valign="top">Great composition and post editing that makes it look dramatic. 7</td>', 'Great composition and post editing that makes it look dramatic. 7', '2008-12-05 14:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5109722, 742818, 67841, '<td valign="top">emotive - his pose, the way his feet are curled up &amp; the look on his face all make me sad - I think this would have made a spectacular B&amp;W...</td>', 'emotive - his pose, the way his feet are curled up & the look on his face all make me sad - I think this would have made a spectacular B&W...', '2008-12-05 14:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5109727, 743657, 67841, '<td valign="top">well done!  very nice moment &amp; the detail is exquisite -- 9 --</td>', 'well done!  very nice moment & the detail is exquisite -- 9 --', '2008-12-05 14:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5109729, 741864, 18655, '<td valign="top">Very sharp and well executed! :) 8</td>', 'Very sharp and well executed! :) 8', '2008-12-05 14:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5109733, 743734, 67841, '<td valign="top">very pretty locale - nice diffuse light really helped this along - well executed, good luck!  -- 8 --</td>', 'very pretty locale - nice diffuse light really helped this along - well executed, good luck!  -- 8 --', '2008-12-05 14:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5109735, 743221, 18655, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait. The girl has a good expression but I wish her lips hadn''t looked as chapped. Some editing could maybe have made them look better. 7</td>', 'Beautiful portrait. The girl has a good expression but I wish her lips hadn''t looked as chapped. Some editing could maybe have made them look better. 7', '2008-12-05 14:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5109737, 739968, 67841, '<td valign="top">Very, very nice!  I like this one quite a bit - nice contrast with 3 interesting elements for each of the zones.  Technically well executed, too - good luck!  -- 10 --</td>', 'Very, very nice!  I like this one quite a bit - nice contrast with 3 interesting elements for each of the zones.  Technically well executed, too - good luck!  -- 10 --', '2008-12-05 14:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5109743, 736523, 67841, '<td valign="top">nice moment - interesting colors - good luck!</td>', 'nice moment - interesting colors - good luck!', '2008-12-05 14:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5109750, 743657, 18655, '<td valign="top">Very sharp! You clearly have good glass. A beautiful image although shots of animal faces in a cage (I assume...) is not as impressive as some of the other shots in this challenge. I wish the water/drool had been removed as it for some reason gives me a bad taste in my mouth (I know, I have issues! :) ). Still... 8 for a very nice looking photography.</td>', 'Very sharp! You clearly have good glass. A beautiful image although shots of animal faces in a cage (I assume...) is not as impressive as some of the other shots in this challenge. I wish the water/drool had been removed as it for some reason gives me a bad taste in my mouth (I know, I have issues! :) ). Still... 8 for a very nice looking photography.', '2008-12-05 14:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5109756, 743283, 18655, '<td valign="top">Very nice with a good composition.</td>', 'Very nice with a good composition.', '2008-12-05 14:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5109765, 742637, 67841, '<td valign="top">very cool scene - I see it''s been validated, glad I waited on this one because I have to say I was wondering myself.  The tree in the immediate background looks added and it is odd that the distortion of the pillars doesn''t seem to match the people.  Maybe it is a painted backdrop &amp; this is a scene from a play - that would certainly explain the discrepancies &amp; the strange mix of colors... good luck! -- 7 --</td>', 'very cool scene - I see it''s been validated, glad I waited on this one because I have to say I was wondering myself.  The tree in the immediate background looks added and it is odd that the distortion of the pillars doesn''t seem to match the people.  Maybe it is a painted backdrop & this is a scene from a play - that would certainly explain the discrepancies & the strange mix of colors... good luck! -- 7 --', '2008-12-05 14:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5109766, 741450, 67841, '<td valign="top">inviting - a very relaxing scene  -  good luck... -- 7 --</td>', 'inviting - a very relaxing scene  -  good luck... -- 7 --', '2008-12-05 14:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5109773, 743614, 18655, '<td valign="top">Oi... I like this - a lot!<br/> <br/>The make-up is very appropriate. This is also very creative making me wonder what you were thinking when you planned and composed this. It''s not over done in any way and you managed to deal with white on white without any burned out areas.<br/> <br/>An exciting image! 10</td>', 'Oi... I like this - a lot! The make-up is very appropriate. This is also very creative making me wonder what you were thinking when you planned and composed this. It''s not over done in any way and you managed to deal with white on white without any burned out areas. An exciting image! 10', '2008-12-05 14:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5109775, 742969, 67841, '<td valign="top">Interesting processing, I like the textures -- that''s a sweet looking Hofner, too</td>', 'Interesting processing, I like the textures -- that''s a sweet looking Hofner, too', '2008-12-05 14:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5109780, 742897, 67841, '<td valign="top">cute!</td>', 'cute!', '2008-12-05 14:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5109782, 743445, 18655, '<td valign="top">The clarity of the water is just amazing. A great shot! 7</td>', 'The clarity of the water is just amazing. A great shot! 7', '2008-12-05 14:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5109791, 743152, 18655, '<td valign="top">Wow! I love this set-up and composition. The way both models are dressed is very appropriate for the shot. Him thinking and while fixated on her and her looking away with an excellent expression is just awesome. I love it!<br/> <br/>The painting in the background makes it all come together. Without a doubt: 10!</td>', 'Wow! I love this set-up and composition. The way both models are dressed is very appropriate for the shot. Him thinking and while fixated on her and her looking away with an excellent expression is just awesome. I love it! The painting in the background makes it all come together. Without a doubt: 10!', '2008-12-05 14:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5109794, 743419, 18655, '<td valign="top">Very colorful and lots of action. Good crop although I wish you had used a wide angle and made it even more interesting. 7</td>', 'Very colorful and lots of action. Good crop although I wish you had used a wide angle and made it even more interesting. 7', '2008-12-05 15:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5109799, 738553, 67841, '<td valign="top">Wow - well done.  When I see shots this tight, I immediately think that the bird is in captivity, so I have to say that usually I''m not as impressed.  But I''m putting that aside on this one because it is really such a nice capture.  There''s great detail in that piercing gaze, isn''t there?!  It''s a little over-exposed on his head though &amp; I only mention that because it caught my eye &amp; that led me to notice the LCA (green fringe) around the edge of his head.  But don''t let me put a downer on an otherwise great shot!  -- 9 -- Good luck!</td>', 'Wow - well done.  When I see shots this tight, I immediately think that the bird is in captivity, so I have to say that usually I''m not as impressed.  But I''m putting that aside on this one because it is really such a nice capture.  There''s great detail in that piercing gaze, isn''t there?!  It''s a little over-exposed on his head though & I only mention that because it caught my eye & that led me to notice the LCA (green fringe) around the edge of his head.  But don''t let me put a downer on an otherwise great shot!  -- 9 -- Good luck!', '2008-12-05 15:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5109802, 743462, 67841, '<td valign="top">Indeed!   Beautifully done... -- 9 --</td>', 'Indeed!   Beautifully done... -- 9 --', '2008-12-05 15:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5109803, 743570, 18655, '<td valign="top">What happened that makes her oblivious to the water pouring out of the can? I love images that make me think of what the photographer as thinking while planning composing the shot. Exciting image! 8</td>', 'What happened that makes her oblivious to the water pouring out of the can? I love images that make me think of what the photographer as thinking while planning composing the shot. Exciting image! 8', '2008-12-05 15:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5109804, 742642, 67841, '<td valign="top">nice!</td>', 'nice!', '2008-12-05 15:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
