(5109811, 743709, 18655, '<td valign="top">Nice I guess... but when you have a horizon in a shot it just has to be level unless you went for a drastic effect by tilting it. But that doesn''t look appropriate to me for this particular image. The sky looks nice though.</td>', 'Nice I guess... but when you have a horizon in a shot it just has to be level unless you went for a drastic effect by tilting it. But that doesn''t look appropriate to me for this particular image. The sky looks nice though.', '2008-12-05 15:05:08.000000', NULL, 1),
