(5109972, 736509, 67841, '<td valign="top">Great, great location - such a sweet feel to it.  The burst of gold from the leaves was brought out nicely, as was the bits of moss here &amp; there.  The pose is nice, and the expression is thoughtful &amp; contemplative without being morose.  The horizontal orientation does give a bit of claustrophobic feel to it, but I just love the texture of the stone walls so I''ll happily endure it.  Nicely done!  -- 8 --</td>', 'Great, great location - such a sweet feel to it.  The burst of gold from the leaves was brought out nicely, as was the bits of moss here & there.  The pose is nice, and the expression is thoughtful & contemplative without being morose.  The horizontal orientation does give a bit of claustrophobic feel to it, but I just love the texture of the stone walls so I''ll happily endure it.  Nicely done!  -- 8 --', '2008-12-05 16:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5109984, 739220, 67841, '<td valign="top">These can be done in so many ways, this is one that I never explored (looks like a duplicated layer heavily blurred, and laid over at about 60% with either a soft light or overlay transfer mode).  The composition is very inviting and I just love the contrast between the two leaves - yum!  A spectacular piece, simple yet engaging! -- 10 --</td>', 'These can be done in so many ways, this is one that I never explored (looks like a duplicated layer heavily blurred, and laid over at about 60% with either a soft light or overlay transfer mode).  The composition is very inviting and I just love the contrast between the two leaves - yum!  A spectacular piece, simple yet engaging! -- 10 --', '2008-12-05 16:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5110053, 743422, 67841, '<td valign="top">Fabulous scene - the IR, or pseudo IR process, looks nice here!</td>', 'Fabulous scene - the IR, or pseudo IR process, looks nice here!', '2008-12-05 16:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5110071, 743463, 67841, '<td valign="top">Cool image, lot of interesting pieces that lead your eye around &amp; to the face.  <br/> <br/>Between the hat (Alice in Wonderland), the colors (particularly the green) and the subject''s face (kind of looks like Keanu Reeves) it has this ''Matrix'' theme happening.  <br/> <br/>The selective focus works nice here, too - which can''t always be said of images that employ that vehicle.  This is a nice image overall - good luck!  -- 8 --</td>', 'Cool image, lot of interesting pieces that lead your eye around & to the face.   Between the hat (Alice in Wonderland), the colors (particularly the green) and the subject''s face (kind of looks like Keanu Reeves) it has this ''Matrix'' theme happening.   The selective focus works nice here, too - which can''t always be said of images that employ that vehicle.  This is a nice image overall - good luck!  -- 8 --', '2008-12-05 16:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5110079, 743292, 67841, '<td valign="top">Nice, simple image...</td>', 'Nice, simple image...', '2008-12-05 16:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5110082, 742696, 67841, '<td valign="top">Sublime location - makes me want to explore the rest of the frame...  Can''t help but wonder if a higher vantage point would have given a better view of the river snaking off into the distance, adding to the leading lines element that is hinted at with this composition.  Color is a bit over-saturated at first, but that feeling fades as you sit with for a bit.  -- 7 --</td>', 'Sublime location - makes me want to explore the rest of the frame...  Can''t help but wonder if a higher vantage point would have given a better view of the river snaking off into the distance, adding to the leading lines element that is hinted at with this composition.  Color is a bit over-saturated at first, but that feeling fades as you sit with for a bit.  -- 7 --', '2008-12-05 16:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
