(5112656, 743665, 63269, '<td valign="top">I like the gloomy effect the blur gives, but I almost wish something was in focus... or perhaps that the subject was more prominent? In any case though, you''ve done a great job evoking a very mournful mood here, and the composition is terrific - excellent work.</td>', 'I like the gloomy effect the blur gives, but I almost wish something was in focus... or perhaps that the subject was more prominent? In any case though, you''ve done a great job evoking a very mournful mood here, and the composition is terrific - excellent work.', '2008-12-06 18:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5112663, 741528, 63269, '<td valign="top">If it weren''t for the title, I wouldn''t have been able to figure out that was a cigar... Imho, the crop is a bit too tight. I wonder how this might look if you could see the end of the cigar, and even had a little smoke if possible? Just a thought.</td>', 'If it weren''t for the title, I wouldn''t have been able to figure out that was a cigar... Imho, the crop is a bit too tight. I wonder how this might look if you could see the end of the cigar, and even had a little smoke if possible? Just a thought.', '2008-12-06 18:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
