(5112677, 743291, 63269, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to this one, and I hardly know what to say...I''m not sure I would have had the courage to take this. This is so full of grim sorrow, and yet there is love portrayed too, somehow... I''m completely blown away - this is one of those shots that I will probably never forget. A very, very powerful and moving photo. 9</td>', 'I keep coming back to this one, and I hardly know what to say...I''m not sure I would have had the courage to take this. This is so full of grim sorrow, and yet there is love portrayed too, somehow... I''m completely blown away - this is one of those shots that I will probably never forget. A very, very powerful and moving photo. 9', '2008-12-06 18:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
