(5112847, 743361, 40718, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  WEll lit except I wonder if the catchlights don''t overwhelm her eyes.  Almost feels like this is Kiwiness (which is a great compliment). 7</td>', 'Interesting.  WEll lit except I wonder if the catchlights don''t overwhelm her eyes.  Almost feels like this is Kiwiness (which is a great compliment). 7', '2008-12-06 21:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
