(5113010, 743636, 90414, '<td valign="top">B/W leaves this rather anti-climactic - the colored stage lighting (for me) is what makes concert photography so vibrant and intense. Compositionally excellent however.</td>', 'B/W leaves this rather anti-climactic - the colored stage lighting (for me) is what makes concert photography so vibrant and intense. Compositionally excellent however.', '2008-12-06 22:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5113021, 739564, 90414, '<td valign="top">Despite the high key affect, I wish there was more detail visible in the lips and nose... I do really like seeing one eye in shadow from the hat though.</td>', 'Despite the high key affect, I wish there was more detail visible in the lips and nose... I do really like seeing one eye in shadow from the hat though.', '2008-12-06 22:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5113029, 743578, 30861, '<td valign="top">After considerable contemplation, I have bumped this extraordinary image up two levels: it is, as of now, one of two tens I have given in the challenge.</td>', 'After considerable contemplation, I have bumped this extraordinary image up two levels: it is, as of now, one of two tens I have given in the challenge.', '2008-12-06 22:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5113033, 743617, 30861, '<td valign="top">This has got to be de Sousa, and it is extraordinary. One of my two 10''s in this challenge.</td>', 'This has got to be de Sousa, and it is extraordinary. One of my two 10''s in this challenge.', '2008-12-06 22:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5113052, 742853, 90414, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition. The star trails are just long enough to give a blurred look however. Longer or brighter trails might help, imo.</td>', 'Beautiful composition. The star trails are just long enough to give a blurred look however. Longer or brighter trails might help, imo.', '2008-12-06 22:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5113053, 742848, 1031, '<td valign="top">Intense colors give this a painterly look to me -- I''m sure it would look great printed on canvas.</td>', 'Intense colors give this a painterly look to me -- I''m sure it would look great printed on canvas.', '2008-12-06 22:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5113076, 740734, 1031, '<td valign="top">Yikes! Either that or a <b>really</b> bad case of sensor dust. ;-)<br/> <br/>Nice pastel quality to the <i>pastorale</i> below the action.</td>', 'Yikes! Either that or a really bad case of sensor dust. ;-) Nice pastel quality to the pastorale below the action.', '2008-12-06 22:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5113080, 738990, 90414, '<td valign="top">Nice ethereal mood, but I just don''t find enough subject in focus.</td>', 'Nice ethereal mood, but I just don''t find enough subject in focus.', '2008-12-06 22:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5113087, 743152, 90414, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot... reminiscent of a vintage LIFE magazine shot.</td>', 'Interesting shot... reminiscent of a vintage LIFE magazine shot.', '2008-12-06 22:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5113100, 741528, 1031, '<td valign="top">Duplicate and flip this and you have a well-executed variation on the "do you see faces or a vase?" optical illusion ... :-)</td>', 'Duplicate and flip this and you have a well-executed variation on the "do you see faces or a vase?" optical illusion ... :-)', '2008-12-06 22:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5113148, 743657, 39850, '<td valign="top">9 - Excellent title, very apt.  Excellent clarity too, especially like the drops on the chin.</td>', '9 - Excellent title, very apt.  Excellent clarity too, especially like the drops on the chin.', '2008-12-06 23:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5113162, 741231, 39850, '<td valign="top">9 - Beautiful colors and smooth feel.  I''d hazard a guess this would be a ''stop you in your tracks'' image wall sized.  Up to 9 from 8.</td>', '9 - Beautiful colors and smooth feel.  I''d hazard a guess this would be a ''stop you in your tracks'' image wall sized.  Up to 9 from 8.', '2008-12-06 23:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5113168, 737191, 1031, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure about the follow-through but that''s a pretty good-looking roll. ;-)</td>', 'I''m not sure about the follow-through but that''s a pretty good-looking roll. ;-)', '2008-12-06 23:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5113445, 743542, 15643, '<td valign="top">The smoke completes this shot so perfectly. I love the body art and the lighting on her skin is spot on. I especially like the hair. (The result of a lot of gel?) If I were to find something wrong with this image it would be the fact that the model is confined to herself. I think it would add to the image to have an opening made by the arms, or by the legs, that would let you see through to the background. But im just nit picking. 8</td>', 'The smoke completes this shot so perfectly. I love the body art and the lighting on her skin is spot on. I especially like the hair. (The result of a lot of gel?) If I were to find something wrong with this image it would be the fact that the model is confined to herself. I think it would add to the image to have an opening made by the arms, or by the legs, that would let you see through to the background. But im just nit picking. 8', '2008-12-07 03:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5113455, 741528, 25355, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, but it''s a bit hard to tell that it is a cigar (I wouldn''t have known if not for the title). At first I thought it was some kind of rail leading behind him, rather than coming out of his mouth.</td>', 'Great lighting, but it''s a bit hard to tell that it is a cigar (I wouldn''t have known if not for the title). At first I thought it was some kind of rail leading behind him, rather than coming out of his mouth.', '2008-12-07 04:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5113456, 743755, 25355, '<td valign="top">Totally cool.</td>', 'Totally cool.', '2008-12-07 04:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5113457, 742726, 25355, '<td valign="top">At first glance at the thumbnail, I thought this was boat ribbing. But that sure is a lot of empty building space.</td>', 'At first glance at the thumbnail, I thought this was boat ribbing. But that sure is a lot of empty building space.', '2008-12-07 04:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5113458, 743221, 25355, '<td valign="top">It seems the two blacks borders are in vogue... ;-Þ</td>', 'It seems the two blacks borders are in vogue... ;-Þ', '2008-12-07 04:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5113470, 739636, 25355, '<td valign="top">I bet there are no prizes for guessing whose this is. ;-Þ<br/>Another slightly quirky but well-done effort.</td>', 'I bet there are no prizes for guessing whose this is. ;-ÞAnother slightly quirky but well-done effort.', '2008-12-07 04:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5113472, 743657, 25355, '<td valign="top">I am a sucker for tiger pictures...<br/>I am a sucker for tiger pictures...<br/>I am a sucker for tiger pictures...<br/>I am a sucker for tiger pictures...</td>', 'I am a sucker for tiger pictures...I am a sucker for tiger pictures...I am a sucker for tiger pictures...I am a sucker for tiger pictures...', '2008-12-07 04:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
