(5113735, 743544, 67258, '<td valign="top">A really strong photo that fuses landscape with socio-documentary.  I have returned to this several times over the week, and it continues to impress.</td>', 'A really strong photo that fuses landscape with socio-documentary.  I have returned to this several times over the week, and it continues to impress.', '2008-12-07 10:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5113737, 741231, 67258, '<td valign="top">I live the very modern minimalist feel to this.</td>', 'I live the very modern minimalist feel to this.', '2008-12-07 10:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5113738, 735858, 67258, '<td valign="top">What a lovely dreamy image you have presented.</td>', 'What a lovely dreamy image you have presented.', '2008-12-07 10:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5113741, 743341, 67258, '<td valign="top">Very cute image, with clear appeal, but from a technical standpoint the photo confuses me; the depth of field appears to be sharp from the nearest point through to the furthest visible part of  the mother, which is a good choice, BUT there are several ''smudged'' areas.  At first I put it down to overly-heavy use of noise reduction software, but the fact that there is such good texture elsewhere in the photo would suggest that is unlikely.  Whatever the reason, I do find the textureless areas off-putting.</td>', 'Very cute image, with clear appeal, but from a technical standpoint the photo confuses me; the depth of field appears to be sharp from the nearest point through to the furthest visible part of  the mother, which is a good choice, BUT there are several ''smudged'' areas.  At first I put it down to overly-heavy use of noise reduction software, but the fact that there is such good texture elsewhere in the photo would suggest that is unlikely.  Whatever the reason, I do find the textureless areas off-putting.', '2008-12-07 10:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5113748, 739931, 51597, '<td valign="top">Am fond of photographing birds. This is superb detail, position, clarity, and most of all of a cardinal..</td>', 'Am fond of photographing birds. This is superb detail, position, clarity, and most of all of a cardinal..', '2008-12-07 10:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
