(5113942, 736918, 32767, '<td valign="top">Sherwin-The composition looks a bit static but I wonder if you packaged it this way not to offend the voters (or those who don''t understand that tilts are ok). I prefer this...<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=562238" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/55000-59999/57882/120/562238.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/55000-59999/57882/120/562238.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/55000-59999/57882/120/562238.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>a cool perspective that I haven''t seen before. I wish you''d went there, instead.</td>', 'Sherwin-The composition looks a bit static but I wonder if you packaged it this way not to offend the voters (or those who don''t understand that tilts are ok). I prefer this...   a cool perspective that I haven''t seen before. I wish you''d went there, instead.', '2008-12-07 13:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
