(5114064, 742853, 60195, '<td valign="top">Stunning image.  Will be very interesting to see how you acheived the clarity on the swan in such a long exposure.  I''m guessing you were able to hit it with a very focused beam at the end. However you did it... well done.  Bumping up.</td>', 'Stunning image.  Will be very interesting to see how you acheived the clarity on the swan in such a long exposure.  I''m guessing you were able to hit it with a very focused beam at the end. However you did it... well done.  Bumping up.', '2008-12-07 14:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5114075, 738279, 60195, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Guessing AP here.  Love the tones, lighting, and overall feel of the image.  (If not AP, consider that a strong compliment).</td>', 'Very nice.  Guessing AP here.  Love the tones, lighting, and overall feel of the image.  (If not AP, consider that a strong compliment).', '2008-12-07 14:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5114088, 743445, 60195, '<td valign="top">Stunning clarity. What an awesome setting.</td>', 'Stunning clarity. What an awesome setting.', '2008-12-07 14:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5114092, 741864, 61961, '<td valign="top">I usually find that photographs of tech objects (circuitry, computer screens, discs) are boring and somewhat lazy on the part of the photographer, but this is very different.  For a brief moment I thought it was an aerial shot with post-processing miniturization.  Well done.<br/> <br/>PS: Back to bump this up a notch. :-)</td>', 'I usually find that photographs of tech objects (circuitry, computer screens, discs) are boring and somewhat lazy on the part of the photographer, but this is very different.  For a brief moment I thought it was an aerial shot with post-processing miniturization.  Well done. PS: Back to bump this up a notch. :-)', '2008-12-07 14:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5114093, 743192, 60195, '<td valign="top">Awesome power.  Great composition &amp; perspective.</td>', 'Awesome power.  Great composition & perspective.', '2008-12-07 14:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5114171, 742181, 60195, '<td valign="top">Back to comment.  This stands out, which says a lot in a Master''s FS.  Wonderful use of shadows, subtle tones, &amp; creative lighting to create a stunning image. Well done.</td>', 'Back to comment.  This stands out, which says a lot in a Master''s FS.  Wonderful use of shadows, subtle tones, & creative lighting to create a stunning image. Well done.', '2008-12-07 15:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5114203, 741010, 40718, '<td valign="top">Heh.  Cute caption.  I think I like the strong color cast. 7</td>', 'Heh.  Cute caption.  I think I like the strong color cast. 7', '2008-12-07 15:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5114205, 737982, 40718, '<td valign="top">Wonderful deep eyes.  DOF is spot on.  I may have cloned the white blotch in the BG as it is mildly distracting. 8</td>', 'Wonderful deep eyes.  DOF is spot on.  I may have cloned the white blotch in the BG as it is mildly distracting. 8', '2008-12-07 15:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5114206, 737191, 40718, '<td valign="top">Very cute capture.  The shot might be looking for one stop faster shutter speed as there is just a tiny bit of motion blur.  I either like motion blur to be totally absent, or obvious as an effect.  I like the bright overexposed nature of the alley. 7</td>', 'Very cute capture.  The shot might be looking for one stop faster shutter speed as there is just a tiny bit of motion blur.  I either like motion blur to be totally absent, or obvious as an effect.  I like the bright overexposed nature of the alley. 7', '2008-12-07 15:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5114207, 738128, 40718, '<td valign="top">The darkness of the canvas works here.  It draws us straight to his eyes. 7</td>', 'The darkness of the canvas works here.  It draws us straight to his eyes. 7', '2008-12-07 15:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5114208, 743651, 40718, '<td valign="top">Dang.  I got jaggies and pixellation in the colors.  Nice simple composition. 5</td>', 'Dang.  I got jaggies and pixellation in the colors.  Nice simple composition. 5', '2008-12-07 15:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5114210, 743600, 40718, '<td valign="top">Works in its abstract qualities.  I like the yellows. 7</td>', 'Works in its abstract qualities.  I like the yellows. 7', '2008-12-07 15:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5114211, 743490, 40718, '<td valign="top">There are so many rocks of differernt types, I''m not sure where the focus is supposed to be.  You help a bit with the DOF, but I''m not sure why one rock is to be thought of as "more important" than any other. 6</td>', 'There are so many rocks of differernt types, I''m not sure where the focus is supposed to be.  You help a bit with the DOF, but I''m not sure why one rock is to be thought of as "more important" than any other. 6', '2008-12-07 15:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5114214, 739882, 40718, '<td valign="top">I don''t quite understand why the central anther has an OOF portion.  I guess it is the closest to us although the optical illusion is that it is pointed "into" the picture.  ANyway, great detail in the rest, but that OOF portion bothers me a bit.  Nice control of the whites in the BG. 7</td>', 'I don''t quite understand why the central anther has an OOF portion.  I guess it is the closest to us although the optical illusion is that it is pointed "into" the picture.  ANyway, great detail in the rest, but that OOF portion bothers me a bit.  Nice control of the whites in the BG. 7', '2008-12-07 15:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5114216, 742109, 40718, '<td valign="top">Waitaminute.  I''ve seen that hair and those eyes before... :)  I like the veil.  I don''t like the oversaturated reds in her blouse.  Otherwise very well done. 7</td>', 'Waitaminute.  I''ve seen that hair and those eyes before... :)  I like the veil.  I don''t like the oversaturated reds in her blouse.  Otherwise very well done. 7', '2008-12-07 15:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5114217, 743403, 40718, '<td valign="top">Spring?  I think the processing done on her back and the gauze detract a bit.  A classic pose. 5</td>', 'Spring?  I think the processing done on her back and the gauze detract a bit.  A classic pose. 5', '2008-12-07 15:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5114218, 739002, 40718, '<td valign="top">An owl right?  You got the right portion in focus, although I''d prefer more DOF from this sideways angle.  The crop is nice. 6</td>', 'An owl right?  You got the right portion in focus, although I''d prefer more DOF from this sideways angle.  The crop is nice. 6', '2008-12-07 15:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5114223, 739220, 40718, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract.  I wish it were a bit sharper.  Perhaps it is a limitation of your lens. 6</td>', 'Nice abstract.  I wish it were a bit sharper.  Perhaps it is a limitation of your lens. 6', '2008-12-07 16:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5114225, 741231, 40718, '<td valign="top">The blues are nice and I enjoy the compositional section of green.  Even though this picture is simple, I like it. 8</td>', 'The blues are nice and I enjoy the compositional section of green.  Even though this picture is simple, I like it. 8', '2008-12-07 16:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5114228, 743191, 40718, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.  An interesting choice.  On one hand the stairs give us a foreground subject, but on the other they are rather ugly and I personally hate the "hand of man" in my own landscapes. (I just entered a shot where a staircase like that, much smaller in the composition, just got completely cloned out)  Personally I''m guessing I would have walked 30 feet forward and left the stairs out.  The rest of the picture is great.  I love the water and rocks. 7 (8-9 without the stairs).</td>', 'Hmmm.  An interesting choice.  On one hand the stairs give us a foreground subject, but on the other they are rather ugly and I personally hate the "hand of man" in my own landscapes. (I just entered a shot where a staircase like that, much smaller in the composition, just got completely cloned out)  Personally I''m guessing I would have walked 30 feet forward and left the stairs out.  The rest of the picture is great.  I love the water and rocks. 7 (8-9 without the stairs).', '2008-12-07 16:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5114229, 743741, 40718, '<td valign="top">Looks like the colors are pushed a bit too far.  Nice composition. 7</td>', 'Looks like the colors are pushed a bit too far.  Nice composition. 7', '2008-12-07 16:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5114235, 743266, 40718, '<td valign="top">These trees are hard to shoot, they oversharpen so fast.  You did well.  The oranges are controlled as well. 6</td>', 'These trees are hard to shoot, they oversharpen so fast.  You did well.  The oranges are controlled as well. 6', '2008-12-07 16:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5114239, 742353, 40718, '<td valign="top">Well Bree, your other one was better.  Either that or we have a bit of diminishing returns.  The magentas don''t look right with the clouds.  Still, a classic. 7</td>', 'Well Bree, your other one was better.  Either that or we have a bit of diminishing returns.  The magentas don''t look right with the clouds.  Still, a classic. 7', '2008-12-07 16:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5114241, 743226, 40718, '<td valign="top">An interesting snap.  I don''t like the half lady in teh BG. 5</td>', 'An interesting snap.  I don''t like the half lady in teh BG. 5', '2008-12-07 16:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5114247, 743654, 40718, '<td valign="top">cute pose.  candid with her eyes closed.  The whites look like they were hard to control and the rest of the image looks like it could use a tiny bit more contrast. 6</td>', 'cute pose.  candid with her eyes closed.  The whites look like they were hard to control and the rest of the image looks like it could use a tiny bit more contrast. 6', '2008-12-07 16:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
