(5114274, 739931, 40718, '<td valign="top">I love cardinals.  I miss them on the west coast.  Darn if you couldn''t have cut that branch out. 7</td>', 'I love cardinals.  I miss them on the west coast.  Darn if you couldn''t have cut that branch out. 7', '2008-12-07 16:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5114277, 740891, 40718, '<td valign="top">You must have been shooting at 1.8 or lower because the DOF is razor thin.  It looks like one eye is slightly more in focus than the other.  Maybe it''s just my eyes playing a trick on me.  They are nicely pimped, BTW. 7</td>', 'You must have been shooting at 1.8 or lower because the DOF is razor thin.  It looks like one eye is slightly more in focus than the other.  Maybe it''s just my eyes playing a trick on me.  They are nicely pimped, BTW. 7', '2008-12-07 16:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5114278, 739636, 73452, '<td valign="top">yea coley!  thats the way to do it!  Take em all down!  Awesomenss as usual, your such an inspiriation</td>', 'yea coley!  thats the way to do it!  Take em all down!  Awesomenss as usual, your such an inspiriation', '2008-12-07 16:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5114279, 741898, 40718, '<td valign="top">Nice blues punctuated by the yellows in the reflection.  The composition is pleasing how it takes the eye across the canvas. 7</td>', 'Nice blues punctuated by the yellows in the reflection.  The composition is pleasing how it takes the eye across the canvas. 7', '2008-12-07 16:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5114281, 743657, 40718, '<td valign="top">Tigers are so beautiful aren''t they?  Great sharpness and I love the full on gaze. 8</td>', 'Tigers are so beautiful aren''t they?  Great sharpness and I love the full on gaze. 8', '2008-12-07 16:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
