(5114285, 739112, 40718, '<td valign="top">Fun, but it looks a bit strong on the NI as seen in his hair. The colors are what we''d expect from an underwater shot, but I can''t say they please me. 6</td>', 'Fun, but it looks a bit strong on the NI as seen in his hair. The colors are what we''d expect from an underwater shot, but I can''t say they please me. 6', '2008-12-07 16:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5114290, 740474, 40718, '<td valign="top">I like the dimples of her lower back.  An interesting picture.  Why would you pick her to do this?  Is it posed?  Is it candid?  I can''t decide.  Either way, why does she have her top off? 6</td>', 'I like the dimples of her lower back.  An interesting picture.  Why would you pick her to do this?  Is it posed?  Is it candid?  I can''t decide.  Either way, why does she have her top off? 6', '2008-12-07 16:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5114291, 743598, 40718, '<td valign="top">I like the grainy quality and the monotone.  Great composition. 8</td>', 'I like the grainy quality and the monotone.  Great composition. 8', '2008-12-07 16:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5114295, 740662, 40718, '<td valign="top">Seems to be missing just a bit of sharpness.  It might be the PP.  Nicely captured smoke. 7</td>', 'Seems to be missing just a bit of sharpness.  It might be the PP.  Nicely captured smoke. 7', '2008-12-07 16:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5114297, 743376, 40718, '<td valign="top">Full on cat poses are great.  Their eyes are so expressive.  I hate to say it, because it''s not helpful, but there''s something letting the shot down, but darned if I can put words to it.  Sorry. 6</td>', 'Full on cat poses are great.  Their eyes are so expressive.  I hate to say it, because it''s not helpful, but there''s something letting the shot down, but darned if I can put words to it.  Sorry. 6', '2008-12-07 16:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
