(5115226, 742853, 38032, '<td valign="top">A seemingly impossible capture.  Definitely represents expert composition, technique, and rule understanding.  Bringiing the swan out so vividly in teh dark just creates an emotive quality only found very rarely in still images.  I believe the kids nowadays might say this is "sick" ... I use the old standbye "Wow".  10</td>', 'A seemingly impossible capture.  Definitely represents expert composition, technique, and rule understanding.  Bringiing the swan out so vividly in teh dark just creates an emotive quality only found very rarely in still images.  I believe the kids nowadays might say this is "sick" ... I use the old standbye "Wow".  10', '2008-12-07 22:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
