(5115781, 743378, 68947, '<td valign="top">Ha....still get trolls in a Masters Challenge! ;-) (those who handed out the 3''s and 4''s....have rocks for brains!)<br/> <br/>I really love the light coming through the flower and leaf.  Really nicely done!!!  Congrats on your score in such a rough challenge.  It''s competing against so many talented photographers so, very nicely done, Michelle!  Congrats!</td>', 'Ha....still get trolls in a Masters Challenge! ;-) (those who handed out the 3''s and 4''s....have rocks for brains!) I really love the light coming through the flower and leaf.  Really nicely done!!!  Congrats on your score in such a rough challenge.  It''s competing against so many talented photographers so, very nicely done, Michelle!  Congrats!', '2008-12-08 00:52:54.000000', NULL, 0),
