(5115804, 743174, 75328, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> This is buckety, perhaps too simple for bucket, but the quality of the light and the b/w processing is great. It''s also great how close she is to the edge of the frame and she looks out of it. There''s a lot of energy and rebellion in the composition. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>kind of felt the same thing.<br/> <br/>i love that she is looking out of the frame. the play with light is really good.</td>', 'Originally posted by posthumous: This is buckety, perhaps too simple for bucket, but the quality of the light and the b/w processing is great. It''s also great how close she is to the edge of the frame and she looks out of it. There''s a lot of energy and rebellion in the composition.   kind of felt the same thing. i love that she is looking out of the frame. the play with light is really good.', '2008-12-08 01:02:00.000000', NULL, 0),
