(5115816, 743701, 66384, '<td valign="top">This is one of my 10s. I can''t believe it didn''t score higher. What is this fixation with sharpness? It looks great to me. (Maybe it''s time for new glasses.) I love the processing. The color and contrast are great. And the crop is perfect.</td>', 'This is one of my 10s. I can''t believe it didn''t score higher. What is this fixation with sharpness? It looks great to me. (Maybe it''s time for new glasses.) I love the processing. The color and contrast are great. And the crop is perfect.', '2008-12-08 01:08:51.000000', NULL, 0),
