(5116599, 738990, 61651, '<td valign="top">So ethereal, Andi, a wonderful pinhole capture - congrats on the best pinhole score so far!  Sorry you didn''t make the lensless best - so close!  Commenters'' score avg is fantastic...</td>', 'So ethereal, Andi, a wonderful pinhole capture - congrats on the best pinhole score so far!  Sorry you didn''t make the lensless best - so close!  Commenters'' score avg is fantastic...', '2008-12-08 09:26:52.000000', NULL, 0),
