(5116619, 743570, 61961, '<td valign="top">The pouring watering can was such an inspired touch.  Beautiful model; I like all the brown tones though I wonder if it''s too overpowering.  Maybe a touch more color or white somewhere (milk in the watering can?).  Just an idea, anyhow, I would have placed this effort much higher.</td>', 'The pouring watering can was such an inspired touch.  Beautiful model; I like all the brown tones though I wonder if it''s too overpowering.  Maybe a touch more color or white somewhere (milk in the watering can?).  Just an idea, anyhow, I would have placed this effort much higher.', '2008-12-08 09:33:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(5116639, 743339, 73942, '<td valign="top">The colors are fantastic!</td>', 'The colors are fantastic!', '2008-12-08 09:41:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(5116649, 743772, 61961, '<td valign="top">I remember seeing this photo earlier in the month -- you must have posted it to your portfolio for awhile.  It''s very striking, though for my taste the eyes are a bit overdone.  I think a subtler (more evenly drawn) line around the pupils would be less artificial.  Overall though it''s a good, flattering self-portrait.</td>', 'I remember seeing this photo earlier in the month -- you must have posted it to your portfolio for awhile.  It''s very striking, though for my taste the eyes are a bit overdone.  I think a subtler (more evenly drawn) line around the pupils would be less artificial.  Overall though it''s a good, flattering self-portrait.', '2008-12-08 09:46:32.000000', NULL, 0),
