(5117039, 743291, 65319, '<td valign="top">This photo carries a deep and disturbing weight of its own and I kept returning to it throughout the week far more than any other in this challenge.  A bravery exists here and strong courage.  But in all honesty, if I were your mother, I would send you straight to your room for posting such a photo of me in the Master''s Challenge!  I do hope you will share a photo of her in happier times when she has recovered.  <br/> <br/>I wish your family well and your mother a speedy recovery.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-12-08 12:05:16.</i></td>', 'This photo carries a deep and disturbing weight of its own and I kept returning to it throughout the week far more than any other in this challenge.  A bravery exists here and strong courage.  But in all honesty, if I were your mother, I would send you straight to your room for posting such a photo of me in the Master''s Challenge!  I do hope you will share a photo of her in happier times when she has recovered.   I wish your family well and your mother a speedy recovery.', '2008-12-08 11:59:22.000000', '2008-12-08 12:05:16.000000', 0),
