(5118172, 743291, 30861, '<td valign="top">Ah, JJ... I was very moved by this, didn''t know if I was looking at illness or death, nor did it seem to matter, I thought, for surely the latter looms close. I gave two 10''s in this challenge, and this was one of my 9''s.<br/> <br/>Fantastic work from a terrible spring. May God speed her to her rest.</td>', 'Ah, JJ... I was very moved by this, didn''t know if I was looking at illness or death, nor did it seem to matter, I thought, for surely the latter looms close. I gave two 10''s in this challenge, and this was one of my 9''s. Fantastic work from a terrible spring. May God speed her to her rest.', '2008-12-08 21:20:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(5118173, 742637, 56744, '<td valign="top">Striking and unique. Magical and misterious. A great example of what can be done when we have the will to do it. Congrats for this amazing image.</td>', 'Striking and unique. Magical and misterious. A great example of what can be done when we have the will to do it. Congrats for this amazing image.', '2008-12-08 21:21:07.000000', NULL, 0),
