(5118398, 743174, 82985, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677021" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award Nominee!<br/>stark, dramatic, old-school-master style of contrast<br/> composition--she is nearly out of frame, and looking out, but the sunlit wall pulls the image back into frame.  superb.</td>', 'PostLuminous Award Nominee!stark, dramatic, old-school-master style of contrast composition--she is nearly out of frame, and looking out, but the sunlit wall pulls the image back into frame.  superb.', '2008-12-08 22:56:16.000000', NULL, 0),
