(5118429, 741864, 17203, '<td valign="top">Laurie just asked me why this didn''t score higher, so I''ll post my two cents here as well:<br/> <br/><i>It''s clever, but too technical- almost cartoonish in execution, and the composition is rather centered and static. He needed to take it a step further into realism with fog, waves or warm "sunset" light from a low angle to be taken seriously enough for this challenge IMO. It might have worked better as a B&amp;W cityscape, since color distracts from the concept. The idea is brilliant, but the execution should be more serious/artsy. Bear in mind that I gave it an 8.</i></td>', 'Laurie just asked me why this didn''t score higher, so I''ll post my two cents here as well: It''s clever, but too technical- almost cartoonish in execution, and the composition is rather centered and static. He needed to take it a step further into realism with fog, waves or warm "sunset" light from a low angle to be taken seriously enough for this challenge IMO. It might have worked better as a B&W cityscape, since color distracts from the concept. The idea is brilliant, but the execution should be more serious/artsy. Bear in mind that I gave it an 8.', '2008-12-08 23:06:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(5118431, 743550, 82985, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677020" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677020.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677020.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677020.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award WINNER!<br/>BEAUTIFULLY dynamic, lustrous, luminous skin tones, lovely subject--superbly done!</td>', 'PostLuminous Award WINNER!BEAUTIFULLY dynamic, lustrous, luminous skin tones, lovely subject--superbly done!', '2008-12-08 23:06:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(5118434, 743221, 82985, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677020" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677020.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677020.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677020.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award WINNER!<br/>flawless to my eye</td>', 'PostLuminous Award WINNER!flawless to my eye', '2008-12-08 23:07:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(5118551, 742853, 63503, '<td valign="top">This is such a beautiful image. I am sure many are puzzled by the super sharp bird in a 60-120 sec (or longer?) exposure. My brother and I were trying to guess the technique, we have a few ideas but hope Alex will be kind enough to share the real deal.</td>', 'This is such a beautiful image. I am sure many are puzzled by the super sharp bird in a 60-120 sec (or longer?) exposure. My brother and I were trying to guess the technique, we have a few ideas but hope Alex will be kind enough to share the real deal.', '2008-12-09 00:08:24.000000', NULL, 0),
