(5118702, 743193, 90495, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by KarenNfld:</b></div><hr/><i> Quote:<i>And please stop complaining about how often a subject has ben done, it''s just a matter of how it has ben done. There are images of an owl and a bald eagle on the front page again for the hundredth time (no offense, Peter), yet noone complains.</i> <br/> <br/>AMEN! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Hallelujah! Give this man a cigar!<br/> <br/>I''m planning the ultimate DPC shot. A water droplet, paper, glass macro of a frog with big round yellow eyes eating an insect, a very colourful insect.</td>', 'Originally posted by KarenNfld: Quote:And please stop complaining about how often a subject has ben done, it''s just a matter of how it has ben done. There are images of an owl and a bald eagle on the front page again for the hundredth time (no offense, Peter), yet noone complains.  AMEN!   Hallelujah! Give this man a cigar! I''m planning the ultimate DPC shot. A water droplet, paper, glass macro of a frog with big round yellow eyes eating an insect, a very colourful insect.', '2008-12-09 01:52:01.000000', NULL, 0),
