(5119959, 738553, 42196, '<td valign="top">You shot this with the 105 AIS!<br/>Awesome job.<br/>One of my favorite lenses when my subject is not moving.<br/>Wish it would meter on my 90 like it does on your 300... oh well, chimp works.<br/> <br/>eta What was your aperture?<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-12-09 15:58:33.</i></td>', 'You shot this with the 105 AIS!Awesome job.One of my favorite lenses when my subject is not moving.Wish it would meter on my 90 like it does on your 300... oh well, chimp works. eta What was your aperture?', '2008-12-09 15:57:53.000000', '2008-12-09 15:58:33.000000', 0),
