(5121315, 738553, 39427, '<td valign="top">sigh... Peter, If i had to be beaten off the front page by someone I''m glad it was you!  congrats on the double feature this week, that is not a simple feat to accomplish</td>', 'sigh... Peter, If i had to be beaten off the front page by someone I''m glad it was you!  congrats on the double feature this week, that is not a simple feat to accomplish', '2008-12-10 01:52:51.000000', NULL, 0),
