(5121833, 743617, 72929, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the win. My only 2 critiques of the photo are:<br/>- the virgin Mary''s blue shawl looks like a cape for the red cross guy, since his jumpsuit is the same shade of blue.. I didn''t even see her at first, she was so well camouflaged.<br/>- The beam of light on the floor directly underneath Jesus is distracting. At first I thought it was a painted line on the floor, but closer examination reveals it''s the backlight. I would recommend dodging/burning to hide it.<br/> <br/>This looks like a nice recreation of a classic painting.</td>', 'Congratulations on the win. My only 2 critiques of the photo are:- the virgin Mary''s blue shawl looks like a cape for the red cross guy, since his jumpsuit is the same shade of blue.. I didn''t even see her at first, she was so well camouflaged.- The beam of light on the floor directly underneath Jesus is distracting. At first I thought it was a painted line on the floor, but closer examination reveals it''s the backlight. I would recommend dodging/burning to hide it. This looks like a nice recreation of a classic painting.', '2008-12-10 07:38:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(5122329, 743617, 20941, '<td valign="top">Spectacular!!</td>', 'Spectacular!!', '2008-12-10 10:46:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(5122368, 743617, 41357, '<td valign="top">I would have shuffled the results of this challenge a bit, but this one would have stayed on the top - bravo</td>', 'I would have shuffled the results of this challenge a bit, but this one would have stayed on the top - bravo', '2008-12-10 11:06:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(5122372, 742853, 80904, '<td valign="top">Bummer Alex. But that is still a beautiful image.</td>', 'Bummer Alex. But that is still a beautiful image.', '2008-12-10 11:09:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(5122383, 742853, 36606, '<td valign="top">It doesnt make sense at all. the swan turns up, I flash it. it was very dark and he disappeared into darkness on all the next 10 frames.<br/> <br/>the thing is is thatthe stars are c hanging compositio in all the frames. how is that different from the swan being there and then not being there?</td>', 'It doesnt make sense at all. the swan turns up, I flash it. it was very dark and he disappeared into darkness on all the next 10 frames. the thing is is thatthe stars are c hanging compositio in all the frames. how is that different from the swan being there and then not being there?', '2008-12-10 11:13:42.000000', NULL, 0),
