(5128298, 742853, 30982, '<td valign="top">Fret not the DQ - minor nit in the real world, after all.  This made a lot of us (well, me at least) stop to appreciate the illusion, and getting voters to stop to appreciate an illusion is pretty darn good.  ''Tis a fine and imaginative photograph.  Loved your regular FS as well - was one of my top three in that challenge.</td>', 'Fret not the DQ - minor nit in the real world, after all.  This made a lot of us (well, me at least) stop to appreciate the illusion, and getting voters to stop to appreciate an illusion is pretty darn good.  ''Tis a fine and imaginative photograph.  Loved your regular FS as well - was one of my top three in that challenge.', '2008-12-13 06:59:59.000000', NULL, 0),
