(5130182, 743617, 83224, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by HawkeyeLonewolf:</b></div><hr/><i> Wow... Amazingly offensive to those of the Christian faith. </i></td></tr></table>Not in the slightest. Emotive, inspiring, reverent and respectful. Brilliant.</td>', 'Originally posted by HawkeyeLonewolf: Wow... Amazingly offensive to those of the Christian faith. Not in the slightest. Emotive, inspiring, reverent and respectful. Brilliant.', '2008-12-14 11:08:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(5130274, 743617, 68586, '<td valign="top">Jorge - another magnificent shot, full of attention to detail, and rich in empathy.<br/> <br/>This is a shot that, as has been mentioned, provides more and more detail as you look at it. It captures in a single shot a moment of awesome emotion and interaction. Far from losing any accuracy by moving this to modern clothing, I think it helps engage our brains in the brutal reality of the moment, the raw pain and emotion, the very real mixed actions and reactions of the crowd.<br/> <br/>Offensive ? It really shouldn''t be - except in the realisation of the brutality of crucifixion . .</td>', 'Jorge - another magnificent shot, full of attention to detail, and rich in empathy. This is a shot that, as has been mentioned, provides more and more detail as you look at it. It captures in a single shot a moment of awesome emotion and interaction. Far from losing any accuracy by moving this to modern clothing, I think it helps engage our brains in the brutal reality of the moment, the raw pain and emotion, the very real mixed actions and reactions of the crowd. Offensive ? It really shouldn''t be - except in the realisation of the brutality of crucifixion . .', '2008-12-14 12:26:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(5130331, 740041, 45524, '<td valign="top">This is a very powerful image. And certainly deserved to place higher then it did. Adding to favs.</td>', 'This is a very powerful image. And certainly deserved to place higher then it did. Adding to favs.', '2008-12-14 12:57:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(5130358, 743598, 30982, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done.  Laurie <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/user_id/29009.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/user_id/29009.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/user_id/29009.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=29009" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">L2</a> added some thoughts about this shot in a thread and she did a good job of articulating what I saw in this.  First, it''s an excellent photograph and really nice HDR work without looking cartoonish at all.  But second, and more importantly, it does, in the face of destruction, show the hope of a new cycle of growth to come.</td>', 'Beautifully done.  Laurie  L2 added some thoughts about this shot in a thread and she did a good job of articulating what I saw in this.  First, it''s an excellent photograph and really nice HDR work without looking cartoonish at all.  But second, and more importantly, it does, in the face of destruction, show the hope of a new cycle of growth to come.', '2008-12-14 13:13:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(5130383, 743598, 30861, '<td valign="top">I thought I''d commented on this already. It''s a wonderful image, beautifully post-processed. It fascinates me that such devastation is positively *glowing* in this image, it''s a great juxtaposition.</td>', 'I thought I''d commented on this already. It''s a wonderful image, beautifully post-processed. It fascinates me that such devastation is positively *glowing* in this image, it''s a great juxtaposition.', '2008-12-14 13:37:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(5130608, 743291, 3032, '<td valign="top">Admireable, you put so much emotion in your photos. They have been my favourites for years now. While painful, photos like this are so important later. Live is all, birth and death, joy and pain. It''s all part of it, you can not have one without the other. Thanks so much for sharing this and all the best to you, your mum and your family.</td>', 'Admireable, you put so much emotion in your photos. They have been my favourites for years now. While painful, photos like this are so important later. Live is all, birth and death, joy and pain. It''s all part of it, you can not have one without the other. Thanks so much for sharing this and all the best to you, your mum and your family.', '2008-12-14 16:15:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(5130618, 738279, 8891, '<td valign="top">Love the toning and the awesome perspective. Glad to see you got there. Hope everything was ok....it''s very quiet,no? Great result!<br/> <br/>And Yo, Enzo! It is Philly (Philadelphia!) Not NYC! LOL!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-12-14 16:25:55.</i></td>', 'Love the toning and the awesome perspective. Glad to see you got there. Hope everything was ok....it''s very quiet,no? Great result! And Yo, Enzo! It is Philly (Philadelphia!) Not NYC! LOL!', '2008-12-14 16:22:00.000000', '2008-12-14 16:25:55.000000', 0),
(5131067, 735858, 52130, '<td valign="top">I think it''s lovely in a kind of an impressionist way, but I (like your wife) had a need for things to be sharp and it does make me a little sick to my stomach if I look at for too long.</td>', 'I think it''s lovely in a kind of an impressionist way, but I (like your wife) had a need for things to be sharp and it does make me a little sick to my stomach if I look at for too long.', '2008-12-14 22:51:55.000000', NULL, 0),
