(5139703, 743283, 12253, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition and scene layout Steve!  Perhaps less noise ninja would have helped--surely ou don''t need it at ISO 200 on your camera!  There does seem to be texture missing, but maybe even without the noise ninja, maybe not as much as would enhance the photo (you have texture where the wall and door are degraded, but not the surface textures themselves.)</td>', 'Excellent composition and scene layout Steve!  Perhaps less noise ninja would have helped--surely ou don''t need it at ISO 200 on your camera!  There does seem to be texture missing, but maybe even without the noise ninja, maybe not as much as would enhance the photo (you have texture where the wall and door are degraded, but not the surface textures themselves.)', '2008-12-18 18:44:09.000000', NULL, 0),
