(6118391, 739513, 40718, '<td valign="top">I only looked at the comments after I formulated what I was thinking and see Bear called you a Bear-clone.  I have to agree this looks like his special little location.  Was it?  Anyway, I didn''t remember this was your Masters'' entry.  I do still think the colors are a bit overdone, but this is a sky to die for.  Have you ever thought about starting a cloud library where you can take shots to superimpose in the BG or landscapes?  I''ve toyed with it but wish I had a location close to my house that allows a pretty unobstructed view of the horizon.  You could sort by direction, time of day, etc.  Anyway, a sky like this is pure photographic gold.</td>', 'I only looked at the comments after I formulated what I was thinking and see Bear called you a Bear-clone.  I have to agree this looks like his special little location.  Was it?  Anyway, I didn''t remember this was your Masters'' entry.  I do still think the colors are a bit overdone, but this is a sky to die for.  Have you ever thought about starting a cloud library where you can take shots to superimpose in the BG or landscapes?  I''ve toyed with it but wish I had a location close to my house that allows a pretty unobstructed view of the horizon.  You could sort by direction, time of day, etc.  Anyway, a sky like this is pure photographic gold.', '2010-08-04 21:09:03.000000', NULL, 0),
